Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.48,0:05:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 杰克 - 布鲁斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jack. - Bruce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.56,0:05:38.49,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克 听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.52,0:05:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你马上让所有人离开大楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to get everyone out of the building. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.86,0:05:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 明白吗 - 天呐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You understand? - My god.
