Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.53,0:05:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 快 大家快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Come on, start moving now, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.20,0:05:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 老板要我们离开大楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. The boss wants us out of the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.38,0:05:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,都赶紧的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, let's make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.63,0:05:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克 杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack. Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.54,0:07:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 所有线路正忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're sorry. All circuits are busy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.38,0:07:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,请稍后再拨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you please try you call again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.74,0:07:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heavenly god.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.37,0:07:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,天堂与人间的创造者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creator of heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.56,0:07:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,宽恕我的灵魂吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have mercy on my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,杰克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}JACK !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.28,0:08:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,大家牵好手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buddy hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.57,0:08:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看 真棒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody show me. Good job
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,大家快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,牵紧了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩先生 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Wayne! Mr. Wayne!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.71,0:08:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我的腿没知觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't feel my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.52,0:08:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的腿没知觉了 - 我们这里需要人帮忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't feel my legs. - We need help over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.09,0:08:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我 我的腿没知觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me. I can't feel my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你会没事的 听见没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to be okay, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.97,0:08:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,沃莱士 他们怎么叫你的 沃利?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wallace. What do they call you, Wally?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,老板 你说了算{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the boss, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.17,0:09:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.58,0:09:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你会没事的 - 小心 小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're going to be okay. - Easy, easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.03,0:09:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 我的腿没知觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh my god. I can't feel my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.48,0:09:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我的腿没...没知觉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't... I can't feel my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.77,0:09:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 你会没事的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. You're going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事的 好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're okay, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 听我说 我们会找到你妈妈的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, you know what? We're going to find your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,她在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,(18个月后)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.28,0:10:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,(印度洋某处)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,(可口可乐)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.29,0:11:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的风都不吉利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that wind is bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是血染长空之兆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blood in the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.71,0:11:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,她到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,(非洲 内罗米)
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.39,0:11:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,莱恩小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.89,0:11:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,莱恩小姐 我是杰米·奥尔森 摄像师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Lane. Jimmy Olsen, photographer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 显而易见 - 希伦在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Obviously. - Where's Heeron?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.40,0:11:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,没能过境{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh. Trouble at the border.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.49,0:12:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么获得许可的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So uh. How'd you land it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.07,0:12:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这还是头一回啊 阿玛迦可从不接受采访{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is like pioneer stuff. Amajagh has never given an interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道希伦跟我一起出任务时总说什么吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what Heeron always says when we are on assignment together?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,她都是闭嘴的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a god damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.31,0:12:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢希伦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like Heron.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.31,0:12:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,护照 电子器件 手机 相机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Passports, electronics, phones, camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你们接头的人说将军准许拍照{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your fixer said that the General approved photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你是恐怖分子吗 将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you a terrorist, general?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.98,0:13:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他们没告诉我做采访的是位女士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They did not tell me the interview was with a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.89,0:13:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是女士 我是记者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not a lady, I'm a journalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.41,0:13:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我这个人 什么都没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I am, is a man with nothing,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.50,0:13:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,只有对我人民的爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except a love of my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.35,0:13:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,这些雇佣兵的开销是谁出的 将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's paying for these security contractors, general?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.25,0:13:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,夜晚在我们头上飞过的无人机又是谁出的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who pays for the drones that passed over our heads at night?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.45,0:13:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,一个问题总会引发另一个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One question begs another.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.31,0:13:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.87,0:13:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你要说什么 将军{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what you're saying, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.65,0:13:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,它只是台相机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.75,0:13:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,美国已声明在你们国家的内战中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The United States has declared it's neutrality
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.80,0:13:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,保持中立 无论是政策上还是原则上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in your country's civil war, both in policy and in principle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,别打开...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, don't open...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.58,0:13:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,被你曝光了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just exposed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.01,0:13:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这些虚伪的美式假话 说得像真理似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These pious American fictions...spoken like truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.94,0:13:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那是我的胶卷 我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, that's my film. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.02,0:14:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,拥有权力的人既不会遵从{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men with power obey neither
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.40,0:14:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,政策 也不会遵从原则 莱恩小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}policy nor principle , Miss Lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.01,0:14:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,谁都一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.27,0:14:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,没人是中立的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one... is neutral.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.81,0:14:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,中情局{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.09,0:14:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在追踪我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're tracking us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.61,0:14:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你是中情局的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're CIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.75,0:14:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 不是 不是的 - 你把他带了过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What?No,no! - You brought him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.25,0:14:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不是 他是个摄像师{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!He's a photographer
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.31,0:14:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.81,0:14:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,跟她无关
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是用她的身份做掩护
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.38,0:14:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,她什么都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.91,0:14:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 露易丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, Lois.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.01,0:14:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,将军 这事有解决的办法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我已被授权提议
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.13,0:15:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,利爪死了 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Talon's down, sir.
