Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.96,0:17:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 目标已锁定 - 你可以开火了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Target locked. - You are clear to engage.
