Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.78,0:17:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,通讯连接被击毁了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Link's been hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.93,0:17:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,被什么击毁的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.91,0:17:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你再走一步 就看她脑袋开花吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take one step, you will see the inside of her head.
