Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.09,0:20:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,大都会再次打爆了哥谭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Metropolis, again, blowing out Gotham city.
