Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.75,0:20:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道哥谭市民是怎么看他们的橄榄球队的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotham City, you know how they are about their football team.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.35,0:20:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.96,0:20:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚这座城市不会太平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things could get ugly in the city tonight.
