Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.62,0:23:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,能别朝好人开枪吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about you don't shoot the good guys, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.56,0:23:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.85,0:23:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他给他烙了印{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He branded him.
