Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.21,0:25:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.07,0:25:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我本想做饭呢 先给你个惊喜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was going to cook. Surprise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.83,0:25:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就发生的事举行了听证会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They held hearings about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.79,0:25:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们都在说... - 我不在乎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're saying that... - I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.59,0:25:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我不在乎他们说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care what they're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.38,0:25:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱的女人差点被炸或中枪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The woman I love could have been blown up or shot
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.09,0:25:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 想想可能的后果吧 - 想想已有的后果吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Think of what could have happened. - Well, think about what did happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.92,0:25:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,那些人不是我杀的 如果他们是那么想的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't kill those men if that's what they think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.84,0:25:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你是那意思的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.97,0:25:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我意思是我想搞清楚发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saying I want to understand what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.97,0:25:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我意思谢谢你救了我的命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saying, thank you for saving my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.93,0:25:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我想说这是有代价的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saying there's a cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.74,0:25:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是不知道可不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't know if it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.43,0:25:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道什么可不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't know what's possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.79,0:26:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,爱我的同时 做你自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you to love me and be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.21,0:26:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克 你会把公寓淹了的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark, you're going to flood the apartment.
