Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.69,0:27:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德 你老了 手脚也慢了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're getting slow in your old age, Alfred.
