Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.53,0:27:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,即便你老得没机会英年早逝了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even you got too old to die young,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.99,0:27:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你也没少为之尝试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not for lack of trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.96,0:27:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,烟囱渡轮黄油块 烟囱渡轮黄油块{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Funnel-ferry butterbar. Funnel-ferry butterbar.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.25,0:27:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,烟囱渡轮黄油块 烟囱渡轮...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Funnel-ferry butterbar. Funnel-ferry...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.18,0:27:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克风没问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing wrong with the microphone.
