Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.44,0:27:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳托里·肯亚佐夫 他是俄国人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anatoli Knyazev. He's Russian.
