Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.79,0:28:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,理论上来说 顺着俄国人这条线 我能找到那个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The theory is that the Russian lead me to the man himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.75,0:28:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他真的是个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he is indeed a him.
