Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.06,0:28:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直是罪犯 从没变过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've always been criminals, nothing's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.90,0:28:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,已经变了 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes it has, sir.
