Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.87,0:28:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有人从天而降{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men fall from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.04,0:28:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神掷下雷电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and gods hurl thunderbolts.
