Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.45,0:29:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,约翰 防守{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} John, get d.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.91,0:29:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你们来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did not know you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.20,0:29:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这就是招牌上的那个人啊 - 别当真{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Man on the marquee. - Stop, don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.95,0:29:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲用他的名字命名了公司 他才是集团二字前的莱克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father named the company after himself. He was the Lex in front of the Corp.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.87,0:29:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 嗨 你好吗 - 好极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hi, how are you doing? - Oh, really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.96,0:29:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,好极了?不错 不错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really great? Good. Good.
