Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.95,0:29:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸为了吸引投资人 就开始说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, uh, Dad started saying that he named
