Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.53,0:29:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸在东德出生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Dad was born in east Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.78,0:29:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他是吃变质饼干长大的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He grew up eating uh... stale crackers.
