Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.54,0:29:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我认为这是天意 他的儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I think it was providence that his son,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.84,0:29:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我 最终得到了这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}me, would end up with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.78,0:30:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我的一个大都会重建组员找到的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of my rebuild Metropolis crews found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.36,0:30:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,来自氪星人世界引擎的一个小纪念品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little souvenir from the Kryptonian World Engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.91,0:30:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,一块石头和国家安全有什么关系{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's a rock have to do with Homeland Security.
