Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.97,0:30:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不 不 女士 是星球安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no... ma'am. Planetary Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.04,0:30:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这个碎块是放射性外太空矿物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fragment is of a radio active Xeno mineral
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.54,0:30:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们怀疑它或许有生物交互作用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We suspected it might have bio interactions,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.99,0:30:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 我们把样本给了陆军传染病医学研究所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so, we took the sample to amriid.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.41,0:30:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.29,0:30:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那里保留着氪星死者的遗体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where they keep the remains of the Kryptonian decedent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.82,0:30:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,当我们将这个矿物接触佐德将军时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, when we exposed general Zod to the mineral,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.25,0:30:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了这样的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.95,0:30:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,强烈的生物降解作用 ​​在衰变氪星人的细胞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Profound biodegradation, decaying Kryptonian cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.51,0:30:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我们断定 如果找到一个足够大的样本 就能武器化这种矿物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We concluded the mineral could be weaponized, if a large enough sample was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.73,0:30:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,后来 在鱼群中 一个大家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then, among the fishes, a whale!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.54,0:30:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,躺在印度洋的海底{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lying at the bottom of the Indian Ocean
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.30,0:30:45.61,Default,,0,0,0,,犹如翡翠城{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emerald City.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.85,0:30:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,美极了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.26,0:30:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这大石头有放射性{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Rocky is radio active, but,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.21,0:30:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,需要你们的一张进口许可证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what he needs from you is an import license.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.47,0:30:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为什么要武器化这种物质{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why would we want to weaponize this material?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.25,0:30:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,用来威慑 预备一颗银弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a deterrent. A silver bullet to keep in reserve
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.29,0:31:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,来对付氪星人 女士 这样你的后辈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to use against the Kryptonians. So, the day doesn't come, Madame,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.03,0:31:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,在检阅台上挥舞雏菊的日子就不会到来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when your children are waving daisies at a reviewing stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.59,0:31:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,据我所知 那些氪星人中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last I looked, the only one of those
