Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.78,0:31:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 但还有...还有更多这一类的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, but, there are... there are more of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.64,0:31:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 超人类论 - 没错 超人类论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The meta-human thesis. - Yes, the meta-human thesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.14,0:31:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这些超常之人很可能生活在我们之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More likely than not. These exceptional beings live among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.67,0:31:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们众多神话的基础 就是我们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bases of our myths. Gods among men upon our...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.49,0:31:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们小蓝星上的人间诸神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}our little blue planet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.19,0:31:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是非得用银弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to use the silver bullet,
