Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.63,0:31:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.09,0:31:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就不用依赖怪物们的仁善了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have to depend upon the kindness of monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.05,0:31:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,(莱克斯集团)
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.41,0:31:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能互相帮助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There're ways we can help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.21,0:31:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,到我这边的办公处来吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you step into my office here?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.38,0:31:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.76,0:31:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你有什么需求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your wish list?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.39,0:31:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,进入坠毁的氪星飞船残骸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Access to the wreck of the crashed Kryptonian ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.35,0:32:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,成交{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.38,0:32:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,(保持通畅  自动门)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.25,0:32:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,还要那个外星人的完整遗体 用于测试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The complete remains of the dead alien for testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.07,0:32:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你想要佐德的尸体?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want Zod's body?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.45,0:32:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.76,0:33:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,樱桃味的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cherry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.50,0:33:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,因为是时候{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the time has come
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.54,0:33:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,让全世界听到另一种声音了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the world to hear the other side of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.54,0:33:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,人们说这个超人是一位英雄 好吧 可又是谁的英雄呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say this Superman is a hero. Okay, but whose hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.80,0:33:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,假如超人现在就在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Superman were here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.01,0:33:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你想对他说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you want to say to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.18,0:33:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对他说 我的家人也有梦想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That my family too had dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.30,0:34:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,并看着他的双眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To look him in his eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.47,0:34:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.19,0:34:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,问他是如何判定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and ask him how he decides
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.48,0:34:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,哪些生命有价值{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which lives count
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.43,0:34:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,哪些生命没有价值{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and which ones do not?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.35,0:34:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,(《星球日报》  超人阻止了导弹袭击  超人英勇营救)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.35,0:34:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,(布鲁斯·韦恩营救员工  一男子被首席执行官从废墟中救出)
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.11,0:34:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,(英雄们)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.61,0:35:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir. Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.64,0:35:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 我说了 下来 快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I said, get down, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.28,0:35:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这里能要些支援吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we get some backup here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.88,0:35:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Hey. Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.21,0:35:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}HEY!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.65,0:35:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,露易丝 罪证化验室 三号线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois. Crime Lab, on 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.86,0:35:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我是莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.78,0:35:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,肯特 今天你负责体育版{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kent, you're sports today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.70,0:35:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你去哥谭 跟进橄榄球方面的消息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to go over to Gotham, follow up on the football.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.45,0:35:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,弱旅梦碎 哥谭与荣耀 相隔10码{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Underdog dreams dashed: Ten yards between Gotham and glory."
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.79,0:35:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,在哥谭自己当心点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch yourself over there at Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.54,0:35:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,别让人抢了你的午餐钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let them take your lunch money.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.95,0:35:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你们在看这个吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Are you guys watching this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.65,0:35:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,紧急救援人员在英雄公园周围快速设防{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency responders quickly created a precautionary perimeter around Heroes Park
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.31,0:36:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.91,0:36:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,同时将此男子从这座受人爱戴的纪念碑上带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while they brought the man down from this beloved monument.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.85,0:36:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,嫌疑人已被确认是沃莱士·弗农·基夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The suspect has been identified as Wallace Vernon Keefe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.18,0:36:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我为布鲁斯·韦恩工作 我为布鲁斯·韦恩工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work for Bruce Wayne! I work for Bruce Wayne!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.18,0:36:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他将受到故意破坏公物及拒捕的指控{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There'll be arraign on charges of vandalism, resisting arrest
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.98,0:36:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.55,0:36:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,并受到一项制造恐怖威胁的重罪指控{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a felony charge of making terrorist threats
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.31,0:36:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这些将导致多达40年的监禁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that carries up to 40 years in prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.57,0:36:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的蠢货{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.49,0:36:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,大都会新闻8台报道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Metropolis news 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.65,0:36:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.91,0:36:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,头条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Headline:
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.95,0:36:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,对空中飞人的强烈好感结束了 问号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"End of love affair with man in the sky, question mark."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.16,0:36:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.91,0:37:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,(哥谭警局)
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.96,0:37:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,她在吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she in?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.92,0:37:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她已经离开了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, she's been gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.71,0:37:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,她干什么了 警官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd she do, officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.50,0:37:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是警察 我是记者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I'm not a cop. I'm a reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.22,0:37:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,住这里的这位年轻女士...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The young lady living here...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.09,0:37:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,她一直没回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, she hasn't been back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.80,0:37:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,她要是聪明 就已经离开这座城市了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, if she's smart, then she's got out of this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.22,0:37:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,而你得在天黑前离开这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you need to get out of here... before dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.02,0:37:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 除非你想撞见他 - 别听他的鬼话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Unless you want to run into him. - Don't listen to that nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.44,0:37:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,只有那些做亏心事的人才害怕他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only people scared of him, people who got reason to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.27,0:37:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,害怕谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scared of who?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.53,0:37:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他的狠辣已不同往日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's a new kind of mean in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.99,0:37:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他很愤怒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.37,0:37:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他正在狩猎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.54,0:37:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们看看你的厉害{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Show 'em what you got!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.08,0:37:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 加油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.04,0:37:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,快出拳{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw a punch, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.25,0:38:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,上啊 加油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.21,0:38:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.35,0:38:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方把运气当成一种侮辱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The house treats luck like an insult.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.51,0:38:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人的好运总会是他兄弟的厄运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck for one is always his brother's misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.91,0:38:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但所有的帐最后都要结平
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.38,0:38:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,和一个波修瓦剧院的芭蕾舞女共度了三晚 她只教了我这一句{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3 nights with a Bolshoi ballerina, that line was all she taught me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.68,0:38:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定不只这一句{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not all I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.01,0:38:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上愉快{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.41,0:38:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,(设备克隆成功)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.02,0:38:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这是恐怖的独裁统治{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a one man reign of terror.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.05,0:39:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这个蝙蝠义警一直在盯着港口{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This bat vigilante has been consistently targeting the port
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.94,0:39:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,还有邻近的工程和廉价公寓{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the adjacent projects and tenements.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.78,0:39:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,在我看来 那些警察其实是在帮他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And as far as I can tell the cops are actually helping him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.98,0:39:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哥谭的犯罪浪潮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Crime wave in Gotham."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.83,0:39:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,其他爆炸性新闻 水是湿的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other breaking news: "Water, wet."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.01,0:39:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 橄榄球的报道写好了吗 - 我们为什么不报道这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you file the football yet? - Why aren't we covering this?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.45,0:39:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,因为穷人不买报纸?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor people don't buy papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.35,0:39:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,人们都不买报纸了 就是这样 肯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People don't buy papers, period, Kent.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.28,0:39:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,佩里 你分派报道时 就是在选择谁重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perry, when you assign a story, you're making a choice about who matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.71,0:39:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁值得 - 终于醒了啊 斯莫维尔土包{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and who's worth it. - Good morning, Smallville.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.85,0:39:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,美国的良心已随罗伯特 马丁和约翰一起死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The American conscience died with Robert, Martin and John.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.98,0:39:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.71,0:39:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没有匹配的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No match.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.02,0:39:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我在罪证化验室的人都没见过这个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My guys in the crime lab, never seen one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.77,0:39:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这叫子弹 开枪打人用的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called a bullet. You shoot people with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.94,0:39:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,从沙漠的交火现场回收的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recovered from the scene of the fire fight in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.69,0:39:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,全世界任何地方都没有商业买卖 连黑市也没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not sold anywhere commercially in the world, even black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.31,0:39:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,所以?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.98,0:39:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以是谁把原型军用子弹给了在撒哈拉的图阿雷格战士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, who gave prototype military rounds to tuareg fighters in the Sahara.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.12,0:39:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你是记者 你来告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are the reporter, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.20,0:39:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为美国政府在宣称支持民选政府的同时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the U.S government is arming the rebels
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.16,0:39:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也在给反叛军提供武装{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while claiming to support the elective government.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.66,0:39:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,直接说想干嘛 露易丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ask, Lois.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.58,0:40:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚飞华盛顿 在那待几天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flight to DC tonight, a couple of days there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.18,0:40:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.35,0:40:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,普通经济舱 不准选大空间座位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coach. No extra leg room.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.91,0:40:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,豪华经济舱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Economy plus.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.28,0:40:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,普通经济舱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coach.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.61,0:40:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么没告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.62,0:40:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在引蛇上身 小露{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're digging up snakes, Lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.38,0:40:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这有点危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's kinda dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.21,0:40:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才没告诉你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I didn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.19,0:40:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,莱恩 你不是要赶飞机吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lane, don't you have a plane to catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.71,0:40:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.45,0:40:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,大都会图书馆的公益活动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Benefit for the Library of Metropolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.63,0:40:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,委员会有人请求克拉克·肯特报道这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone on the committee requested that Clark Kent cover it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.81,0:40:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,大概是某个做慈善的丑老太婆喜欢呆子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Probably some old charity crone has got a thing for nerds.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.38,0:40:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,议员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.76,0:40:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,午餐前喝点波旁酒吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little bourbon before lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.51,0:40:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我司机在外面 我不能久留{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My driver's outside, I can't stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.43,0:41:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不喝波旁酒? 你这样的肯塔基姑娘竟然不喝?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No bourbon? A Kentucky girl like yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.51,0:41:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸总说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad always said that,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.27,0:41:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,肯塔基麦芽浆是健康的秘诀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kentucky mash was the secret to health.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.15,0:41:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这曾是他的房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This was his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.18,0:41:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直保持着原样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kept it just the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.18,0:41:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我把一切都保持原样的话 或许有一天我爸会回来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Maybe one day dad'll come back if I just keep everything the same."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.46,0:41:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这真傻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.08,0:41:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,孤儿的妙想天开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The magical thinking of orphan boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.75,0:41:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会给你的矿物批准进口许可证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm blocking the import license for your mineral.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.98,0:41:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,红披风要来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Red Capes are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.38,0:41:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,红披风要来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Red Capes are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.78,0:41:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你和你听证会的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and your hearings.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.15,0:42:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在街上飞奔 来警告我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Galloping through the streets to warn us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.98,0:42:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.98,0:42:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,从陆地来挂一盏灯 从天上来挂两盏灯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, if by land. Two, if by air.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.01,0:42:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,议员 你知道美国最古老的谎言吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know the oldest lie in America, Senator?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.45,0:42:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我能叫你琼吗 - 你喜欢怎么叫都行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I call you June? - You can call me whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.95,0:42:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,也能把一桶尿叫做奶奶的蜜桃茶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a bucket of piss and call it Granny's peach tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.38,0:42:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,把一件暗杀武器叫做威慑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a weapon of assassination and call it deterrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.48,0:42:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你骗不了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't fool a fly on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.78,0:42:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会上当{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.51,0:42:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 如果我就改变了这房里的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you don't think Dad would mind, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.28,0:42:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,一件东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I change just...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.98,0:42:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我爸是不会介意的吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... just one thing in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.05,0:42:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那东西应该是颠倒过来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because that should be upside-down.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.68,0:42:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们更清楚了 对吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we know better now, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.91,0:42:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,魔鬼并非来自我们下方的地狱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The devils don't come from hell beneath us. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.81,0:43:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们来自天上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, they come from the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.75,0:43:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,(玛莎·韦恩 1946年至1981年)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.58,0:45:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望韦恩家族的下一代不会继承一座空酒窖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope the next generation of Waynes won't inherit an empty wine cellar.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.51,0:45:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,说得可能会有下一代似的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that there's likely to be a next generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.02,0:45:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.01,0:45:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这是那个俄国人手机上打出的所有电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is every call made from the Russian's phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.57,0:45:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,有两通提到了与白葡萄牙人的生意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two mentions of business with the "White Portuguese" and
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.49,0:45:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,并且在继续向亚历山大·卢瑟的私人住所{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's continuing transmitting blacked-out data to the personal residence
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.10,0:45:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,传输隐蔽数据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Alexandra Luthor.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.52,0:45:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你认为莱克斯·卢瑟就是白葡萄牙人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think Lex Luthor is the "White Portuguese"?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.34,0:45:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不出他需要进口武器来赚钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't see that he needs the income from imported arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.22,0:45:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,无论如何 我得在他的房子里放个窃录器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Regardless, I'll need to put a leech at his house,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.58,0:45:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我还需要战衣{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'm going to need the suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.71,0:45:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,蝙蝠审问了六个人 却一无所获{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bat interrogated 6 people and came away with nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.36,0:45:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是布鲁斯·韦恩搞到了信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Bruce Wayne that got the information.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.87,0:45:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩可没法闯进莱克斯·卢瑟的房子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Bruce Wayne can't break into Lex Luthor's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.89,0:45:50.24,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·韦恩不用闯进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruce Wayne won't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.60,0:45:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经被邀请了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.81,0:45:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,(敬请参加 11月1日 晚上7点  由亚历山大·卢瑟举办)
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.77,0:46:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,(哈哈哈 你是个笑话 蝙蝠侠)
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.13,0:47:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 拍张照 - 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have a shot. - Mr. Wayne!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.09,0:47:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.55,0:47:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,那是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.42,0:47:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你一定没听过让他们吃蛋糕的梗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be new to the "let them eat cake" beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.85,0:47:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那是布鲁斯·韦恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is Bruce Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.61,0:47:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有请慈善家 藏书家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Philanthropist. Bibliophile.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.18,0:47:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,大都会图书馆的真朋友 莱克斯·路瑟先生致辞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}True friend of the Library of Metropolis. Mr. Lex Luthor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.28,0:47:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我? 好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? Oh. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.52,0:47:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,尼基{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nicky.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.87,0:47:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我为难了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're embarrassing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.11,0:47:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,演讲 演讲 这个那个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Speech. Speech. Uh, blah blah blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.77,0:47:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,酒水免费{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.05,0:47:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,演讲结束{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.22,0:47:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,慈善家这个词 源于希腊文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The word "philanthropist" comes from the Greek.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.11,0:47:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,意思是博爱之人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meaning a lover of humanity
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.26,0:47:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,约2500年前被创造的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was coined about 2,500 years ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.39,0:47:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 我要往哪走 阿尔弗雷德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, where am I going, Alfred?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.94,0:47:57.15,Default,,0,0,0,,走过电梯 往左{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go past the elevator.Do a left.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.17,0:47:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 一定是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} That's right, must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.23,0:48:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在地下室的服务通道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in the service corridor in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.52,0:48:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,走下楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.65,0:48:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,神明与人类之间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Gods and men.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.28,0:48:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,普罗米修斯选择了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prometheus went with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.54,0:48:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他破坏了宙斯毁灭人类的计划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he ruined Zeus' plan to destroy man kind
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.32,0:48:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,为此 他遭到了雷劈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and for that, he was given a thunderbolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.68,0:48:13.49,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎很不公平{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hm. That seems unfair.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.23,0:48:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,言归正传 大都会图书馆...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the serious note, the Library of Metropolis...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.27,0:48:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,走到你进来时看到的楼梯那 下楼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the stairs. You saw them on your way in. Down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.71,0:48:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,但曾有一段时间 我爸买不了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But at one time, Dad could not buy them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.26,0:48:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我父亲小时候买不起书{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, My father could not afford books growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.46,0:48:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他不得不从垃圾桶里翻出昨天的报纸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had to root through the garbage for yesterday's newspaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.26,0:48:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 你右边是厨房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. You got the kitchens on your right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.94,0:48:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,往左{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Do a left.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.43,0:48:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你前面 就是你要去的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right in front of you, that's where you want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.65,0:48:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I help you, Mr. Wayne?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.93,0:48:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是...以为洗手间在这下面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I just... thought the bathroom was down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.67,0:48:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must have...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.92,0:49:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一杯马提尼量太多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That last Martini was two too many, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.69,0:49:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- 男洗手间在楼上 - 太好了 我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Men's room is upstairs. - Great, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.54,0:49:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢那双鞋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like those shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.72,0:49:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能待在下面 阿尔弗雷德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't stay down here, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.93,0:49:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,上楼交际去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go upstairs and socialize.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.31,0:49:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,找个大都会的年轻女士娶回家{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some young lady from Metropolis will make you honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.78,0:49:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,别做梦了 阿尔弗雷德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In your dreams, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.24,0:49:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,书本就是知识 知识就是力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Books are knowledge, and knowledge is power.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.64,0:49:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,而我... 不...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am... Heh heh heh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.82,0:49:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I, umm.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.96,0:49:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我是什么 我在说什么呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, what am I? What was I saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.26,0:49:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.20,0:49:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,人苦乐参半的悲哀就在于有知识却无力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bittersweet pain among men is having knowledge with no power.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.68,0:49:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,因为...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.39,0:49:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,因为二者互相矛盾 还有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because that is paradoxical, and umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.78,0:49:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢各位光临{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.42,0:49:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,请尽情畅饮{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please drink. Drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.93,0:50:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩先生 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Wayne. Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.61,0:50:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我是克拉克·肯特 星球日报的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark Kent, Daily Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.02,0:50:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我的基金会已发布了支持图书公益的声明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my foundation has already issued a statement in support of books.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.11,0:50:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,先生?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.61,0:50:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,美女一来 品行就败 别引用这句话 好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty girl. Bad habit. Don't quote me, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.95,0:50:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你对哥谭的蝙蝠义警持什么立场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your position on the bat vigilante in Gotham?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.78,0:50:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,星球日报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daily Planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.81,0:50:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,等下 这是我旗下的 还是其他人的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.Do I own this one? Or is that the other guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.04,0:50:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,公民自由权已在你的城市中被践踏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Civil liberties has been trampled on in your city.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.91,0:50:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,善良的人生活在恐惧之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good people living in fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.42,0:50:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不要相信你听到的一切流言 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't believe everything you hear, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.45,0:50:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,是我亲眼所见 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've seen it, Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.65,0:50:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他认为他在法律之上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thinks he's above the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.85,0:50:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,星球日报竟在批评那些自认为在法律之上的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} The daily planet criticizing those who think they're above the law
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.11,0:50:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有点虚伪啊 你不觉得吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a little hypocritical, wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.31,0:50:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,而每次你们的英雄从树上救下一只猫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Considering every time your hero saves a cat out of a tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.18,0:50:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你们就会写一篇吹捧的社论 来报道一个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you write a puff piece editorial, about an alien who...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.52,0:50:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,只要想摧毁整个星球 就能做到的外星人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if he wanted to, could burn the whole place down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.81,0:50:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,真到那时 我们做什么都无法阻止他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There wouldn't be a damn thing we can do to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.85,0:51:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上大多数人并不赞同你的看法 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of the world doesn't share your opinion, Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.25,0:51:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,或许是我心中的哥谭市影响了我 我们只是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's the Gotham city in me, we just...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.37,0:51:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,和穿得像小丑的怪胎们有过一段糟糕的历史{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}... have a bad history with freaks dressed like clowns.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.46,0:51:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 布鲁斯·韦恩和克拉克·肯特相见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boys! Mm, Bruce Wayne meets Clark Kent.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.16,0:51:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢 我喜欢把人们聚到一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, I love it! I love bringing people together!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.01,0:51:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们好啊 - 莱克斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How are we? - Lex.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.21,0:51:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 很好 嗨 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, good. Hi, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.52,0:51:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我是莱克斯 幸会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lex. It is a pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.47,0:51:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,手劲真大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a good grip!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.39,0:51:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,可别和这个人干架{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should not pick a fight with this person.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.44,0:51:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这么多年之后 我们终于把你请到大都会来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, after all these years, we've finally got you over to Metropolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.23,0:51:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来是想喝光你的酒 - 千万别客气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Well, I thought I'd come drink you dry. - Well, you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.65,0:51:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,不过你该常来港湾 我想带你看看我的实验室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should hop the harbor more often, though.I'd love to show you my labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.07,0:51:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,或许我们可以在某方面合作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we could partner on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.62,0:51:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我的研发部喜欢各种邪门歪道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My R&D is up to all sorts of no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.55,0:51:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.55,0:51:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,7分钟了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's 7 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.16,0:51:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,看来传输完成了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look likes the transfer's complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.49,0:51:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卢瑟先生 - 什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mr. Luthor. -  Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.76,0:51:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是州长 - 州长{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The governor. - Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.68,0:51:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 失陪了 - 下次聊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - Next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.02,0:51:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 州长 嗨 - 莱克斯 很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Governor, hi. - Lex, it's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.28,0:52:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,一场致命的工厂大火打断了华雷斯的亡灵节庆典
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.81,0:52:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.51,0:52:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信 他们任由那可怜的女孩死去
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.74,0:53:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们 作为这个星球上的一个族群 一直在寻找一个救世主{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We, as a population on this planet, have been looking for a savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.82,0:53:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,90％的人都信仰神力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}90% of people believe in a higher power.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.41,0:53:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,每一个宗教都信奉着某种救世主形象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every religion believes in some sort messianic figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.58,0:53:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.75,0:53:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,当这个救世主角色真的来到地球时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when this savior character actually comes to Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.77,0:53:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要让他遵守我们的规则?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we want to make him abide by our rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.13,0:53:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须明白 这是一个范式转变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to understand that this is a paradigm shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.46,0:54:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须开始思考超越政治的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to start thinking beyond politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.84,0:54:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这个人身上有任何道德约束吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are there any moral constraints on this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.59,0:54:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有国际法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have international law.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.36,0:54:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,在这个地球上 每一个行为都是一种政治行为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On this Earth, every act is a political act.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.98,0:54:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.89,0:54:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上最强大的人是一个有争议的人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it really surprising, that the most powerful man in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.86,0:54:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这真的令人惊讶吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}should be a figure of controversy?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.98,0:54:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,让一个个体参与国家事务{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To have an individual engaging in the state level interventions
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.35,0:54:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.90,0:54:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这应该让我们深思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}should give us all pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.28,0:54:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,人类有一段可怕的过去 追随强权人物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human beings have a horrible track record of following people with great power
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.58,0:54:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,并导致了严重的人类暴行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}down paths that led to huge human atrocities.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.71,0:54:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.12,0:54:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直在以我们自己的形象创造崇拜对象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have always created icons in our own image.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.87,0:54:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所做的就是把我们自己投射到他身上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we've done is we project ourselves on to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.21,0:54:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,事实是 也许他不是某种魔鬼或耶稣的角色{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact is, maybe he's not some sort of devil or Jesus character.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.04,0:54:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他只是一个试图做正确之事的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he's just a guy trying to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.51,0:54:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在谈论的是一个真实存在的生命体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're talking about a being whose very existence
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.65,0:54:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.71,0:54:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,挑战了我们自身在宇宙中对优先级的认识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}challenges our own sense of priority in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.17,0:54:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你追溯哥白尼 那时他重建了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you go back to Copernicus, where he restored
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.67,0:54:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,已知的宇宙中心 用太阳取代了地球{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the sun in the center of the known universe, displacing earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.10,0:54:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,再看看达尔文的进化论{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you get to Darwinian evolution
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.27,0:55:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就会发现 我们在地球上不是特殊的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you find out, we're not special on this Earth
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.36,0:55:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是其他生命形式中的一种{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're just one among other life forms.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.99,0:55:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们了解到 我们甚至在整个宇宙中都不是特殊的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now we learned, that we're not even special in the entire universe
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.78,0:55:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,因为有超人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because there is Superman.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.15,0:55:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他就在那里 一个在我们之中的外星人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is. An alien among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.86,0:55:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们并不孤单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.90,0:55:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,作为一名美国议员 你是说你能自在地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you, as a United State Senator, personally comfortable
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.41,0:55:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,亲自向一对悲伤的父母说 超人原本可以救你们的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}saying to a grieving parent, "Superman could've saved your child,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.24,0:55:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,但原则上 我们不希望他采取行动?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but on principle we did not want him to act"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.68,0:55:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是说他不该采取行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not saying he shouldn't act.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.26,0:55:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说他不该单方面采取行动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saying he shouldn't act unilaterally.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.52,0:55:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们在这里讨论的是什么呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we talking about here then?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.77,0:55:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是否必须要有一个超人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must there be a Superman?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.33,0:55:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,已经有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.81,0:55:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.78,0:55:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.85,0:55:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.58,0:56:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事 怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.91,0:56:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 我只是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,nothing.I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.01,0:56:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.31,0:56:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.98,0:56:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸怎么从没离开过堪萨斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come Dad never left Kansas?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.76,0:56:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he just...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.49,0:56:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他是什么样的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.34,0:56:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,而我要旅行干嘛呢 我已经旅行了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I need to travel for? I'm already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.18,0:56:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是希望事情能更简单些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just wished it was more simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.60,0:56:37.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我的宝贝孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My baby boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.84,0:56:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,没有什么事是简单的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing was ever simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.84,0:56:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,一个奇怪的小东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An odd little duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.05,0:56:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我从没见过这样的金属{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never seen a metal like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.68,0:57:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是国防部高级研究计划局的黑匣子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be darpa black box.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.52,0:57:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能搞清楚呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, who could find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.06,0:57:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,没人想搞清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody who'd want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.94,0:57:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,或许他们把这些给反叛军是为了做战地测试{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they gave them out to the rebels to test in theater.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.86,0:57:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把活人士兵当实验动物用?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Using live soldiers as guinea pigs?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.03,0:57:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你之所以是个如此出色的记者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this is what makes you such a good reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.55,0:57:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为这种事还是会使你震惊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stuff like this still shocks you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.91,0:57:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,(《哥谭自由报》)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.38,0:57:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,(对哥谭市的犯人们来说 蝙蝠烙印就是死刑判决)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.38,0:57:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,(《星球日报》 几十个罪犯被标上了蝙蝠烙印 被烙者在哥谭的黑门监狱有安全风险)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.21,0:57:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(蝙蝠侠在充当法官 陪审团及处刑人 哥谭身着披风的犯罪斗士是不是太过了呢)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.06,0:57:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,弄不掉了 弄不掉了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It don't come off!It don't come off!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.03,0:57:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,移交囚犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prisoner transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.31,0:57:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能把我关进普通牢房 老兄 他们会杀了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't put me in general, man.  They gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.61,0:57:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你不能带我去普通牢房{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you can't bring me to general.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.98,0:57:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该感谢大都会的纳税人们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be thanking the tax payers of Metropolis
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.78,0:57:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,收容你这被烙的混蛋{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for taking in your branded ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.61,0:57:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 请签字 - 我被标记了 老兄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sign in please. - I'm marked, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.86,0:57:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道他们对有这东西的人会做什么吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what they do to people with this on them?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.11,0:57:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他只是个罪犯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's only a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.17,0:57:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这边 快走 - 他们会杀了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} - This way! Let's go! - They're gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.67,0:57:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们会杀了我 - 快走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're gonna kill me! - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.49,0:58:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,基夫 你被保释了 打开二号{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keefe, you made bail. Open Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.79,0:58:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,谁出的钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who paid?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.14,0:58:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你到底是谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.01,0:58:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就是个人而已 - 是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just a man. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.79,0:58:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈想干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.48,0:58:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,帮你坐稳立场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To help you stand for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.21,0:58:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你三点的预约到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your 3 o'clock's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.67,0:58:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他让我成了一个不完整的男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He made me half a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.95,0:58:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我妻子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.06,0:59:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,离开了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...walked out on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.05,0:59:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至不能站着小便{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't even piss standing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.44,0:59:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,让我对质他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me face him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.98,0:59:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你会处理好吧?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll take care of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.20,0:59:15.81,Default,,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.06,0:59:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.07,0:59:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,退后 让开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back up! Make a hole!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.55,1:00:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,走错地方了 小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong room, miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.62,1:00:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,斯万维克部长 你一直没回我电话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secretary Swanwick, you haven't been returning my phone calls.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.32,1:00:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,莱恩小姐 如果你想采访 那扇门外面就能找到法里斯少校{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Lane, if you like an interview, Major Farris is just outside that door.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.11,1:00:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你把我当成陌生人?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're treating me like a stranger?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.53,1:00:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我把你当成记者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm treating you like a reporter.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.61,1:00:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.78,1:00:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,美国在向非洲的反叛军提供实验性军用武器吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is the US providing experimental military arms to rebels in Africa?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.08,1:00:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你这么有胆量的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know with balls like yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.59,1:00:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,应该属于这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You belong in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.73,1:00:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你的消息来源是什么 锡箔帽吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your source on this? A tin foil hat?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.82,1:00:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不是锡 是金属{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, not tin, but it's metal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.15,1:00:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,在那次超人事件中射出的 五角大楼的专家都无法识别它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fired in the Superman incident. Experts at the Pentagon can't ID it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.91,1:00:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们没有被告知真相 - 真相就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We haven't been told the truth. - Here's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.51,1:00:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一名记者贪求独家新闻 去了她不该去的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A reporter got greedy for a scoop and went where she shouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.39,1:00:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,超人救她时 就像兵痞似的 还导致了多人死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman acted like some... rogue combatant to rescue her and people died.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.27,1:00:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不要用编造阴谋论来放回他的圣环{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't invent a conspiracy theory to put back his halo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.33,1:00:53.94,Default,,0,0,0,,或你的圣环{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.67,1:00:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 少校 - 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Major. - Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.55,1:01:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我登录了你的网盘找复件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I logged into your drop box to find a copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.25,1:01:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.43,1:01:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了这个复件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a copy, alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.64,1:01:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,但却没有关于橄榄球的 没有关于...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, nothing about football. Nothing about...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.21,1:01:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,大都会图书馆的那些朋友的 只有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Friends of the Metropolis Library, just...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.90,1:01:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的哥谭蝙蝠的事 我跟你说了别追{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The god damn Gotham bat thing, I told you not to pursue.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.69,1:01:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,警方不会帮忙 媒体不得不做正确的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The police won't help, the press has to do the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.01,1:01:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,轮不到你来决定是什么正确的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't get to decide what the right thing is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.65,1:01:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,星球报社成立时 是有立场的 佩里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the Planet was founded, it stood for something, Perry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.11,1:01:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,1938年时 的确如此 但现在不是1938年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So could you, if it was 1938, but it's not 1938.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.02,1:01:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,公共事业振兴署不再雇人了 一堆苹果也不再只值几分钱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}WPA aren't hiring no more. Apples don't cost a nickel.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.38,1:01:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,这里不准追 外面也不准 放掉这件事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not in here. Not out there. You drop this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.64,1:01:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,没人在意克拉克·肯特叫板蝙蝠侠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody cares about Clark Kent taking on the Batman.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.96,1:01:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,所以很显然 超人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So apparently superman
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.76,1:01:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不再希望我们把他当成美国人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't want us to think of him as American anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.13,1:01:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,说真的 我们何必呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And really, why would we?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.10,1:01:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我意思是除了那身红蓝服装 还有...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean aside from the red and blue costume. And...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.15,1:01:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢 美利坚合众国的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, the fact that he has
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.60,1:01:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,英文缩写 有三分之一都在他的胸口上了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one-third of the usa's initials on his chest.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.77,1:01:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜他没有把独立宣言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume the only reason he's not wearing
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.37,1:01:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,当披风来穿的唯一原因就是...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the declaration of independence as a cape is...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.34,1:01:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他觉得这样做太招摇了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He thinks it's too on-the-nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.68,1:01:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这里在搞什么 - 不好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is going on back here? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.41,1:02:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 快点 走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.68,1:02:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,打起精神 快出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get yourselves together and get out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.65,1:02:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,把那些玻璃杯都放托盘上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get those glasses on those trays.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.78,1:02:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,外面有客人口渴着呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got thirsty people out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.25,1:02:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,半满 记住 半满{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half full. Remember, half full.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.09,1:02:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能失陪一下吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder, would you excuse us?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.58,1:02:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想带你看样东西 - 抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's something I'd like to show you. - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.73,1:02:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,现在有些学者坚持认为那件事从没发生过...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now some scholars insist that it never happened...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.03,1:02:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,但我相信那种行为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I believe it's the action
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.04,1:02:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,完全符合一个既是国王又是变态杀手的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}perfectly in keeping with a king who was also a psychopathic killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.91,1:02:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,对我而言 这是40年策展的巅峰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For me, it's the culmination of 40 years curating.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.68,1:02:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我简直不敢相信 我终于把它弄来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can't believe it, but I've finally got it here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.95,1:02:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,它就是亚历山大之剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the sword of Alexander.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.42,1:02:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,砍断戈尔迪之结的那把剑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the blade that cut the gordian knot.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.86,1:02:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这是场胜利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a triumph.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.23,1:02:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,的确{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.69,1:02:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 请尽兴 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Enjoy. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.77,1:02:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一件赝品{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.47,1:03:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,真品在98年时在黑市上被卖了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The real one was sold in '98 on the black market.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.27,1:03:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,现在它挂在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now it hangs...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.44,1:03:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,挂在哈杰尔苏丹的床头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over the bed of the sultan of hajar.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.05,1:03:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,失陪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.62,1:03:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.72,1:03:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,前几天晚上 你拿了不属于你的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The other night you took something that doesn't belong to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.95,1:03:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,偷是没教养的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stealing's not polite.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.12,1:03:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,如果从另一个小偷那儿偷 也算偷吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it stealing if you steal from another thief?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.63,1:03:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.26,1:03:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,某个和你关注同一个人的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone interested in the same man you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.16,1:03:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.77,1:03:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信卢瑟先生有一张属于我的照片{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe Mr. Luthor has a photograph that belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.84,1:03:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你拿到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.54,1:03:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上 没 我没拿到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As it happens, no, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.84,1:03:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你复制的数据都有军工级加密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The data you copied has military-grade encryption.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.28,1:03:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我用你这身礼服打赌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, i bet with that dress,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.67,1:03:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,十个男人里有九个愿意让你顺走任何东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}9 out of 10 men will let you get away with anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.45,1:03:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,但你是那第十个?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're the 10th?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.95,1:03:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我是第一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm guessing I'm the first
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.36,1:03:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,看穿你那低幼把戏的男人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see through that babe-in-the-woods act.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.79,1:03:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你不了解我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know me,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.46,1:03:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,但我认识几个你这样的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've known a few women like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.60,1:04:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不觉得你见过我这样的女人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I don't think you've ever known a woman like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.20,1:04:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,人们对于小男孩的说法一点没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's true what they say about little boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.31,1:04:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,天生不会分享{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Born with no natural inclination to share.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.28,1:04:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我没偷你的硬盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't steal your drive.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.51,1:04:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是借用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I borrowed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.78,1:04:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你会在你车上的储物箱里找到它的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll find it in the glove compartment of your car.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.99,1:04:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.81,1:04:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,(已连接)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.75,1:04:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(开始解密)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.90,1:04:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,(解密中)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.09,1:04:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(解密中)
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.33,1:06:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你们拿到了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.47,1:06:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那块石头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rock?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.80,1:06:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拿到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.51,1:06:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,(莱克斯集团)
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.93,1:06:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.70,1:06:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,蹲下 快蹲下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down! Get down now!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.88,1:07:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.80,1:09:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她是我的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was my world.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.14,1:09:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,而你把她从我这夺走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you took her from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.84,1:09:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruce!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.05,1:09:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 现在听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruce! Listen to me now!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.10,1:09:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是露易丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Lois!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.14,1:09:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是露易丝·莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Lois Lane!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.63,1:09:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,她是关键{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's the key!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.00,1:09:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我来太早了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I too soon?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.00,1:09:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我来太早了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm too soon!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.51,1:09:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你对他的看法没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right about him!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.84,1:09:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你对他的看法一直是对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've always been right about him!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.87,1:09:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,警惕他 警惕他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fear him! Fear him!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.85,1:09:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,找到我们 布鲁斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find us, Bruce!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.02,1:09:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须找到我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to find us!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.11,1:10:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,(解密中)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.45,1:10:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,(解密完成)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.25,1:10:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(莱克斯集团)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.28,1:10:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,(《哥谭自由报》 正义的蝙蝠烙印)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.41,1:10:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,(人贩被烙上蝙蝠侠的标记)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.78,1:10:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,(莱克斯集团)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.18,1:10:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,(白葡萄牙人)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.27,1:10:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,(法官)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.34,1:10:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,(陪审团)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.93,1:10:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,(处刑人)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.83,1:10:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,(正义?)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.88,1:10:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,(白葡萄牙人)
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.91,1:11:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,白葡萄牙人不是一个人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The white Portuguese is not a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.57,1:11:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,而是一艘船{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.99,1:11:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩老爷 你从七岁起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Wayne, since the age of seven
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.16,1:11:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,对骗术的掌握就好比{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have been to the art of deception
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.24,1:11:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,莫扎特之于大键琴一般高超{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as Mozart to the harpsichord.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.70,1:11:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但你从来都不善于对我撒谎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you've never been too hot at lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.40,1:11:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,白葡萄牙人装载的不是脏弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The white Portuguese is not carrying a dirty bomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.59,1:11:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,装载的是什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it carrying?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.24,1:11:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,一件武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.38,1:11:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,是一块石头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a rock.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.11,1:11:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,一种能让氪星人细胞衰弱的矿物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A mineral capable of weakening Kryptonian cells.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.71,1:11:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,三个月前 第一块足够大到有用的样本{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first sample big enough to mean something
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.64,1:11:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,出现在了印度洋中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}turned up in the Indian ocean three months ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.60,1:11:36.65,Default,,0,0,0,,它现在在白葡萄牙人上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is now aboard the white Portuguese
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.65,1:11:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,被送到莱克斯·卢瑟那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}being delivered to Lex Luthor.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.11,1:11:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,而我要从他那里偷走它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who I am going to steal it from.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.99,1:11:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,为了不让它落到卢瑟手里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To keep it out of Luthor's hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.93,1:11:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,为了摧毁它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.63,1:11:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.47,1:11:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你是要开战?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna go to war?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.90,1:11:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,那个混蛋两年前就给我们带来了战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That son of a bitch brought the war to us two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.91,1:12:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐 阿尔弗雷德 数数死亡人数吧 有上千人啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus, Alfred. Count the dead. Thousands of people.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.78,1:12:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来呢 上百万吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's next? Millions?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.62,1:12:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他拥有抹去整个人类的力量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has the power to wipe out the entire human race,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.47,1:12:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,哪怕我们认为他只有1%的可能是我们的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if we believe there's even a 1% chance that he is our enemy,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.22,1:12:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都必须把这可能性当成绝对的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have to take it as an absolute certainty.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.26,1:12:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须消灭他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we have to destroy him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.76,1:12:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不是我们的敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he is not our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.18,1:12:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,今天不是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not today.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.39,1:12:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德 哥谭这20年间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20 years in Gotham, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.67,1:12:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都见识了承诺的分量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've seen what promises are worth.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.80,1:12:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,还剩多少善良的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many good guys are left.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.84,1:12:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,又有多少人一直如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many stayed that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.70,1:12:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,给你14个小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.87,1:12:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫克拉克·肯特 来自星球日报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My name is Clark Kent. I'm from the daily planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.00,1:12:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我想了解一个叫桑托斯的囚犯发生了什么事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying to find out what happened to an inmate, a Santos.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.29,1:12:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能对外公布这个信息{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't give out that information.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.48,1:12:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,(蝙蝠来了)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.21,1:13:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.48,1:13:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,桑托斯夫人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Santos?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.89,1:13:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我能问你几个问题吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask you a few questions?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.36,1:13:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是我的丈夫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't my husband.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.16,1:13:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道他干了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I know what he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.04,1:13:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但他是一个父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he was a father.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.86,1:13:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他也身为人父{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was that, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.83,1:13:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们把他带离哥谭中央警署{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They took him out of Gotham central.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.59,1:13:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,把他转移到了大都会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They moved him to Metropolis.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.67,1:13:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们心里清楚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But inside they know.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.57,1:13:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他们完全清楚那个标记 可警卫不管{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They know the mark all over. Guards don't care.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.07,1:13:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,蝙蝠就是法官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bat's the judge.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.54,1:13:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,一个决定谁生谁死的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One man decides who lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.24,1:13:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那样的正义算什么 - 跟我说说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How is that justice? - Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.75,1:13:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 帮我来改变它 - 用什么 你的笔吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help me change it. - With what? Your pen?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.98,1:13:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他那种人 没法用文字阻止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man like that, words don't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.72,1:13:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道什么能阻止他吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what stops him?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.85,1:13:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,拳头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fist.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.45,1:13:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,肯特 我要和你谈谈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kent, I want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.91,1:13:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,(星球日报)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.90,1:13:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,肯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kent!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.43,1:14:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他去哪了 珍妮 他去哪了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where does he go? Where does he go, Jenny?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.75,1:14:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我不...我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.60,1:14:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,他敲了三下鞋跟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clicks his heels three times,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.60,1:14:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.05,1:14:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,回堪萨斯去了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}goes back to Kansas, i suppose.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.41,1:14:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,混...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.71,1:14:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,(白葡萄牙人)
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.06,1:14:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,放{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.82,1:14:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,放{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.91,1:15:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,(莱克斯集团产业)
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.80,1:15:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,收队{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move out!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.06,1:15:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,(尼克尔森集散站及码头公司)
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.44,1:15:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,快开 快开 快开 快开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.61,1:16:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,(镖枪)
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.56,1:16:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.86,1:17:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.74,1:19:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,他们下次再用你的灯照耀天空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time they shine your light in the sky,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.73,1:19:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,别去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}don't go to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.28,1:19:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,蝙蝠已经死了 埋了它吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bat is dead. Bury it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.28,1:19:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就当我手下留情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider this mercy.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.03,1:19:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.59,1:19:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你会流血吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you bleed?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.92,1:19:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.61,1:20:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,(搜索应答器信号)
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.43,1:20:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,(莱克斯集团研究园)
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.37,1:21:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我头上可没圣环 部长先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have a halo over me, Mr. secretary.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.49,1:21:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我去了沙漠 那里有人死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I went into the desert, people died.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.36,1:21:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这让我难以入睡 这是当然的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It keeps me awake. It should.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.19,1:21:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你认为超人是凶手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you think that superman is a murderer,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.89,1:21:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那就把它扔了吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then throw it away.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.89,1:21:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但我相信你不那么认为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't believe you think that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.86,1:21:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我们如何确定什么是善意呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do we determine what's good?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.90,1:21:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,在民主国家 善意就是沟通交流{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a democracy, good is a conversation,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.89,1:21:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,而非单方面的决定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not a unilateral decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.61,1:21:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我敦促超人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I urge superman to come
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.28,1:22:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,明天到这座人民之山来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to this hill of the people tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.08,1:22:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,看看那些遭受了痛苦的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see those who have suffered.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.28,1:22:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.78,1:22:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,世界需要知道在那片沙漠中发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world needs to know what happened in that desert.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.55,1:22:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.05,1:22:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,需要知道他的立场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And to know what he stands for.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.55,1:22:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,他会将他的力量用到哪种程度{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far will he take his power?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.29,1:22:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他是根据我们的意志行事 还是根据他自己的意志{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he act by our will or by his own?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.93,1:22:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,人们讨厌他们不理解的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People hate what they don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.44,1:22:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们看见你的所作所为 就会了解你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they see what you do, and they know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:33.61,1:22:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是杀手 也不是威胁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not a killer, a threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.38,1:22:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来都不希望这个世界拥有你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never wanted this world to have you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.12,1:22:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,做他们的英雄 克拉克 做他们的丰碑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be their hero, Clark. Be their monument.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.65,1:22:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,做他们的天使{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be their angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.49,1:22:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,做他们需要你做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be anything they need you to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.66,1:22:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,或者什么都不做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or be none of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.76,1:22:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你不欠这世界任何东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't owe this world a thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.97,1:23:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,从来都不欠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never did.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.67,1:23:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,德尼罗斯到了 可换乘至凯恩大道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is deniros. Transfer available to Kane Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.50,1:23:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,请当心脚下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, mind your step.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.16,1:23:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我必须跟议员谈话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to speak to the senator today.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.11,1:23:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,今天你不能见议员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot see the senator today.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.75,1:23:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要在听证会之前跟她谈话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to speak to her before the hearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.37,1:23:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你明白这有多重要吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand how important this is?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.21,1:23:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能让你见议员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot let you see the senator.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.25,1:23:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 我得跟她说话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, I need to speak to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.45,1:23:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 女士 我求你了 请别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, madam. I beg of you! Please don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.35,1:23:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这十分重要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is so important!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.86,1:23:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 - 别碰我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come with me. - Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.39,1:23:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 求你了 - 对不起 她不肯走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please! - I'm sorry. She wouldn't leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.36,1:24:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我没告诉你真相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't tell you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.17,1:24:05.07,Default,,0,0,0,,中情局认为沙漠那件事是个圈套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C.I.A Thinks the desert was a setup.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.07,1:24:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有人想加罪于超人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody wanted superman to look guilty.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.48,1:24:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,那子弹呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bullet?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.28,1:24:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那种金属是一家私人公司开发的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The metal was developed by a private company.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.45,1:24:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,什么公司{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What company?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.33,1:24:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,莱克斯集团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lexcorp.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.12,1:24:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,莱克斯·卢瑟?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lex Luthor?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.37,1:24:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他还在那个沙漠围场安插了他的私人雇佣兵{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He also had private security contractors at the desert compound.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.53,1:24:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,公开出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on record.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.34,1:24:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,绝不可能 这是机密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a chance. It's classified.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.89,1:24:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我又恰好喜欢我的工作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I happen to like my job.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.18,1:24:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这说不通{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.39,1:24:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你说那个圈套是为了陷害超人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said that the ambush was arranged to frame superman,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.47,1:24:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,但他们怎么会知道他会出现在...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but how could they know that he'd show up in the...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.71,1:24:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那片沙漠中 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the middle of the desert. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.69,1:24:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 过来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, come on through.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.25,1:25:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,参议院听证会现在随时可能开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The senate hearing is expected to get underway any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.86,1:25:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 最大的未知数就是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And of course the big unknown in all of this is
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.09,1:25:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,超人会出现吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will superman show up?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.62,1:25:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这是他们真正所期盼的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is what they're really waiting to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.75,1:25:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,基夫先生 基夫先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. keefe. Mr. keefe.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.00,1:25:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我是索莉戴·奥伯莱恩 此刻栏目的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soledad o'brien, in the moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.58,1:25:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,问你个问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick question for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.93,1:25:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你就要和议员们见面了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're heading in to meet with the senators.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.42,1:25:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你会跟他们说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will you tell them?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.10,1:25:15.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我是来告诉他们该醒醒了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come here to tell them to wake up.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.04,1:25:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这是血和肉的事实{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.21,1:25:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经带来了一场战争{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has delivered a war here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.84,1:25:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这个...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.91,1:25:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.88,1:25:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是战争的样貌{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what war looks like.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.72,1:25:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我一无所有了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.77,1:25:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,先生 有很多人会说他是他们的英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are plenty of people, sir, who would say he's their hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.78,1:25:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他不是英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is not a hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.69,1:25:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,格蕾丝 能麻烦你让格雷格上来吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grace, can you get Greg up here, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.46,1:25:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,就现在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.66,1:25:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,一个匿名线人能证明每一件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An anonymous source can verify everything
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.86,1:25:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你所说在内罗米发生的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you about what happened in nairomi.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.03,1:25:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 一个匿名线人? - 刊登出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- An anonymous source? - Run it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.10,1:25:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟策划了沙漠事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luthor engineered the desert.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.23,1:25:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,那是给超人设的圈套{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was an ambush for superman.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.40,1:25:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,相信你的记者 想想水门事件{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trust your reporter. Think Watergate.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.08,1:25:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 你得想想打官司的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and you need to think litigate.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.11,1:25:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你是错的 卢瑟会把报社告到不复存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're wrong, Luthor will sue the paper out of existence.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.64,1:25:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你需要证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need proof.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.81,1:25:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样 现在就得刊登出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It needs to run now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.71,1:25:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,在听证会之前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before the hearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.01,1:25:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,如果超人知道了 或许会改变他的说辞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If superman knows, it might change what he says.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.67,1:25:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会拿报社冒险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not going to risk the paper
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.78,1:26:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好让你在课堂上给你的救命恩人递纸条{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that you can pass notes in class to the man that rescued you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.47,1:26:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他贿赂了她?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He paid her?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.56,1:26:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是贿赂了她 他还威胁了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not only paid her. He threatened her.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.12,1:26:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,并给了她一份稿子熟记{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gave her a script to learn.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.53,1:26:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她父母在家里活得好好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her parents are alive back home.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.30,1:26:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不过那姑娘良心发现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the girl's got a conscience.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.30,1:26:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他一直在把委员会当他的木偶剧院来用 - 议员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's been using the committee as his puppet theater. - Senator!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.93,1:26:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 你好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.78,1:26:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,别走开 我有话跟你说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go anywhere. I want to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.28,1:26:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,梅茜 你先进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, you know what? Mercy, you go in
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.71,1:26:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我占好座位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and make sure no one takes my seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.87,1:26:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你要干嘛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what you been up to?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.14,1:26:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是来讲讲我的故事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just here to tell my story.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.37,1:26:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是我想出资造一件威慑氪星人的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That I was willing to finance a Kryptonian deterrent,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.62,1:26:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,但一位肯塔基的资浅议员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but a certain junior senator from Kentucky
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.71,1:26:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,决定要阻止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}decided to block it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.83,1:26:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 专议超人的委员会主席在安全问题上很手软{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the chair of the committee on superman is soft on security.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.85,1:26:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 格雷格 为什么他一直没收到我们的支票 - 他收到了 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Greg, why hasn't he been getting our checks? - He is, Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.72,1:26:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他每个月都会收到一张受害人基金的支票{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gets a check from the victims fund every month.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.19,1:26:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,可他都退回了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He returns them.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.51,1:26:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,(布鲁斯·韦恩 睁开你的双眼)
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.69,1:26:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,在两年前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who lost both his legs...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.05,1:26:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.51,1:26:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,大都会的那些可怕事件中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in those horrific events in Metropolis
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.85,1:26:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,失去了他的双腿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that happened two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.41,1:26:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.15,1:26:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.56,1:26:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,天呐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.85,1:26:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.11,1:26:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,(布鲁斯·韦恩 是 瞎子)
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.67,1:26:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我从没看到过这些{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why haven't I seen this?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.34,1:26:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我会查清楚的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I'll get to the bottom of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.37,1:27:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那 超人来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there he is. Superman is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.24,1:27:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他真的来到了美国国会大厦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is actually at the United States capitol.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.49,1:27:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这真的是一个历史性时刻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is really a historic moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.66,1:27:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们期望超人会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we expect that superman will give
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.82,1:27:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,向议员 向美国人民{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some kind of a statement to the senate,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.89,1:27:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,当然 还有向全世界 给出某种声明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the American people, and, of course, to the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.39,1:27:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他在这里了 他来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's here. He came.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.89,1:27:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,他在国会大厦上面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's above the capitol. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.39,1:27:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,待会儿里面的烫手山芋可不好接啊 小琼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are gonna be on the hot seat in there, junebug.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.21,1:27:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我是在农场里长大的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I grew up on a farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.73,1:27:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,猪我都斗得过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how to wrestle a pig.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.88,1:27:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道美国最古老的谎言吗 议员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know the oldest lie in America, senator?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.44,1:27:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是 力量可以是无辜的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's that power can be innocent.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.41,1:27:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你好运{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.54,1:28:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,小姐...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, miss...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.71,1:28:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,鲁迪 她能进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rudy, she's good to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.84,1:28:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.84,1:28:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,(这里是我们的世界 不是你的    超人是非法外星人)
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.96,1:28:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,滚吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.33,1:28:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 滚吧 快滚 - 超人 超人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out! Get out! - Superman! Superman!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.46,1:28:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,今早又收到一封 韦恩先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another one came this morning, Mr. Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.24,1:29:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,首先 我想感谢我们的证人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me say at the outset that I'm grateful to our witness
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.21,1:29:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢他今天来到我们面前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for coming before us today.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.05,1:29:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,民主就是这么运作的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is how a democracy works.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.13,1:29:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们相互对话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We talk to each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.88,1:29:30.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们经过民众的同意再行事 先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We act by the consent of the governed, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.43,1:29:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前坐在这里说过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have sat here before to say that shadow interventions
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.77,1:29:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,委员会是不会容忍暗箱操作的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will not be tolerated by this committee.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.23,1:29:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.73,1:29:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,也不会容忍谎言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither will lies.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.02,1:29:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,因为今天是真相大白之日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because today is a day for truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.07,1:29:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,因为只有说出...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because only by speaking...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.42,1:30:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,只有携手合作 我们才能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only by working together can we...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.63,1:30:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,才能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we...
