Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.23,1:31:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我是媒体人士 能麻烦你让我进去吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Member of the press. Can you let me in, please?
