Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.68,1:33:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,国会警方现在已确认爆炸是由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Capitol police are now confirming that the blast was caused
