Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.64,1:35:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克 还是我 你能不能...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark, it's me again. Can you...
