Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.69,1:35:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我没看见 恐怕是因为我就没看过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I didn't see it because I wasn't looking.
