Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.29,1:35:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我都在按照我父亲的看法活着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been living my life the way my father saw it.
