Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.64,1:35:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那只不过是一个堪萨斯农民的梦想{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just the dream of a farmer from Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.34,1:35:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,对有些人来说 那个农民的梦想就是一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That farmer's dream is all some people have.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.85,1:35:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,是给了他们希望的一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all that gives them hope.
