Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.13,1:36:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可我的世界已不复存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My world doesn't exist anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.21,1:37:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome.
