Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.62,1:37:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你是否要接管操作{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to assume command?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.29,1:37:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I would.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:44.29,1:37:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我要{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I would.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.43,1:37:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 开始吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well. Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.43,1:37:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,氪星的档案库包含了十万个不同世界的知识{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Kryptonian archive contains knowledge from 100,000 different worlds.
