Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.73,1:41:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那就继续吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then proceed.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.86,1:41:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好的 正在准备生物蛹并开始变形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well. Preparing chrysalis and commencing metamorphosis.
