Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.97,1:41:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,没来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.38,1:42:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还有很多问题没有得到解答{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are still so many unanswered questions.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.32,1:42:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,其中最主要的问题 就是超人是否参与了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chief among them, whether superman was involved
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.43,1:42:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,此次袭击的谋划{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the planning of this attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.77,1:42:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个有着无限力量的个体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, here's an individual who has unlimited power,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.97,1:42:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.39,1:42:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,却没去阻止离他只有几英尺的引爆者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yet did nothing to stop the bomber just a few feet away from him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.39,1:42:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这对调查员们来说 不合情理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just doesn't add up for investigators.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.06,1:42:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,烧死他 烧死他 烧死他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn him, burn him, burn him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.56,1:42:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,烧死他 烧死他 烧死他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn him, burn him, burn him.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.46,1:42:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,给他二十美元 他就当没见过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For twenty American, he didn't see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.63,1:42:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.39,1:42:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道这山上不去
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.09,1:42:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,他是来送死的
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.90,1:43:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,援引当前一名熟悉此案的联调局官员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now one FBI official familiar with this case
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.32,1:43:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我的原话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}told me they found quote,
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.28,1:43:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,在基夫公寓里中了个大奖 发现了炸弹制造材料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"a jackpot of bomb-making materials inside keefe's apartment."
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.91,1:43:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们现在需要查明的是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What they need to determine now is
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.50,1:43:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他是否在谋划与实行过程中得到了他人的协助{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whether he had any help in the planning and execution of the bombing.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.04,1:43:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他们尚未排除{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they haven't ruled out the idea
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.29,1:43:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,超人是同谋的可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that superman was a co-conspirator.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.09,1:43:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 我的线人们告诉我 他们在此事的调查中收到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, my sources are telling me they are getting a barrage of anonymous and credible tips
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.97,1:43:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,大量匿名而又可靠的线索{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with all roads in this investigation
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.09,1:43:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,全都指向了那位氪星来客{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}leading to the Kryptonian visitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.83,1:44:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 露易丝 你该走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Lois. You gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.95,1:44:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,他并不知道自己会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't know he was gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.32,1:44:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,他还买了不少食物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just bought groceries.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.28,1:44:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那个轮椅和沙漠的那颗子弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wheelchair and the bullet from the desert
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.29,1:44:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,都由同种金属制成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were made from the same metal.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.93,1:44:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 沙漠 听证会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. The desert. The hearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.49,1:44:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟想要超人所到之处都是死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everywhere superman goes, Luthor wants death.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.40,1:44:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 卢瑟费了这么大劲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Luthor goes through all of that trouble...
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.67,1:44:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,把轮椅做成了一颗炸弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Creates a bomb out of a wheelchair,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.21,1:44:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,却又加以改造来降低爆炸威力?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then alters it to reduce the blast?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.00,1:44:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.84,1:44:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,轮椅内部衬了铅{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The inside of the chair was lined with lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.98,1:44:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你没法阻止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.31,1:44:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你也看不见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.39,1:45:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不错吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.66,1:45:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们堪萨斯的人都生活在一个平原上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We men of Kansas live on a pancake,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.63,1:45:41.23,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们要来山上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so we come to the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.73,1:45:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,从这里往下 一直到漫滩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All downhill from here, down to the floodplain.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.54,1:45:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,农场就在这世界的最低处{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Farm at the bottom of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.37,1:45:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得有一个时节的洪水很凶猛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember one season the water came bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:53.41,1:45:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那时我还不到12岁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't have been 12.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.34,1:45:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸拿出了铲子 我们拼命挖了一夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad had out the shovels and we went at it all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.35,1:46:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,一直到我晕了过去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We worked till, i think, I fainted.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.52,1:46:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们成功阻挡了洪水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we managed to stop the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.63,1:46:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们拯救了农场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We saved the farm.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.59,1:46:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你奶奶给我烤了个蛋糕 夸我是英雄{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your grandma baked me a cake. Said I was a hero.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.23,1:46:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那天晚些时候 我们发现{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Later that day we found out
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.23,1:46:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是挡住了洪水{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we blocked the water all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.40,1:46:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们把它送回了上游{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We sent it upstream.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.90,1:46:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,朗家的整个农场都被冲走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole lang farm washed away.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.44,1:46:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我在吃我的英雄蛋糕时 他们的马被淹了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While I ate my hero cake, their horses were drowning.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.28,1:46:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前常在睡梦中听见它们的嚎哭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to hear them wailing in my sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.45,1:46:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这样的噩梦有停止过吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did the nightmares ever stop?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.72,1:46:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.09,1:46:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,当我遇到你的母亲时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I met your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.03,1:46:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,她让我相信这世界上还有美好存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She gave me faith that there's good in this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.26,1:46:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她是我的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was my world.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.27,1:46:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我想你 儿子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss you, son.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.78,1:47:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想你 爸爸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss you too, dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.63,1:47:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道你赢不了的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you can't win this.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.97,1:47:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这是自杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.31,1:47:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在比我父亲死时的年纪还大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm older now than my father ever was.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.68,1:47:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这或许是我做的唯一一件有意义的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This may be the only thing i do that matters.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.48,1:47:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,打击犯罪二十年 毫无意义吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20 years of fighting criminals amounts to nothing?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.42,1:47:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,犯罪就像野草 阿尔弗雷德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Criminals are like weeds, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.16,1:47:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,除掉一个 又会在原地长出另一个{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull one up, another grows in its place.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:51.63,1:47:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这关乎世界的未来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is about the future of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:55.60,1:47:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的遗赠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my legacy.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.47,1:48:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲曾让我坐在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father sat me down right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.84,1:48:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我韦恩家族是靠什么起家的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told me what Wayne manor was built on.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.00,1:48:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,铁路 房地产 还有石油{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Railroads, real estates, and oil.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:06.51,1:48:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,第一代和法国人做生意大赚了一笔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The first generation made their fortune trading with the French.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.18,1:48:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,毛皮生意{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pelts and skins.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.68,1:48:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都是猎人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were hunters.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.80,1:48:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,所以韦恩家族会陨落{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So falls the house of Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.57,1:48:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得等待更多证据{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta wait for more evidence,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.37,1:48:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但问题还在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the question still remains,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.34,1:48:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:43.21,1:48:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,如果超人没有参与其中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If superman was not involved,
Dialogue: 0,1:48:45.55,1:48:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他光明磊落 那为何自惨剧发生的那天起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if he's got nothing to hide, then why hasn't he been seen
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.92,1:48:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,一直没看到他现身{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since the day of this tragedy?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.92,1:48:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能把矛头指向...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't point a finger and...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.05,1:48:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都没指啊 沃伦 十根手指在这呢 看见没{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not pointing anything, Warren. Look. Ten fingers, see?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.82,1:48:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有罪犯...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there is going to be a criminal...
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.14,1:50:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,黑夜已至{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The night is here.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:57.88,1:50:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.15,1:51:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我是不是见过...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't I know...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.28,1:52:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,早晨就叫小露 穿便服时就叫露拉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plain lo in the morning. Lola in slacks.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.35,1:52:11.48,Default,,0,0,0,,露易丝·莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois Lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:13.76,1:52:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,来看看风景{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mmm. Come see the view.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.09,1:52:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,高度的秘诀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now the secret to the height
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.30,1:52:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,在于建筑材料{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the building material.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.60,1:52:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,这里用的是轻金属 所以在风中有点晃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's light metals which sway a bit in the wind.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.77,1:52:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你对莱克斯集团的金属也有些了解 对吧 莱恩小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know something about lexcorp metals, don't you, miss Lane?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.11,1:52:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经查实了你的所作所为{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've proven what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:35.98,1:52:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你还真能折腾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, you're feisty.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:38.08,1:52:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜 那一切都将随风而逝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, that will blow away.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.58,1:52:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,就如沙漠中的沙子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like sand in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:42.62,1:52:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个精神病{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're psychotic.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:43.75,1:52:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,狭隘的头脑都是用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a three-syllable word
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.22,1:52:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这个三音节词来描述伟大创想的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for any thought too big for little minds.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:48.03,1:52:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,下个类别 圆圈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm. Next category: Circles.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.56,1:52:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,一圈一圈又一圈 他们到处找超人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Round and round and round they go to find superman.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.33,1:52:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,搞错类别了 少年 应该是三角形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong category, boy. No, no, triangles.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.47,1:52:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 欧几里得的三角不等式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, euclid's triangle inequality.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.07,1:53:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,任意两点之间的最短距离{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shortest distance between any two points
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.27,1:53:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是直线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a straight path.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.07,1:53:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信找到超人的最短直线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I believe the straightest path to superman
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.01,1:53:07.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是一条非常小的路...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a pretty little road...
Dialogue: 0,1:53:08.47,1:53:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,叫露易丝·莱恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Called Lois Lane.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:32.47,1:53:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came back.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.77,1:53:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你回来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You came back.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.36,1:53:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,少年 我们在这是不是有些问题啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy, do we have problems up here!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:02.13,1:54:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,关于世间邪恶的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The problem of... Of evil in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.11,1:54:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,关于至善的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The problem of absolute virtue.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.73,1:54:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会打残你 我要把你收监{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take you in without breaking you.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.90,1:54:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,这更是你应得的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is more than you deserve.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.28,1:54:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,关于你高高在上的问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The problem of you on top of everything else.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:13.17,1:54:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你凌驾于一切之上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You above all.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.88,1:54:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,因为神就是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, because that's what god is.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.38,1:54:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,荷鲁斯 阿波罗 耶和华 卡尔·艾尔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Horus. Apollo. Jehovah. Kal-El.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.75,1:54:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克·约瑟夫·肯特{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark Joseph Kent.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.52,1:54:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,瞧 克拉克·乔 我们对神的称呼取决于我们的部族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, what we call god depends upon our tribe, Clark-Joe.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.73,1:54:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,因为神也分部族 神也选立场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because god is tribal. God takes sides.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:34.86,1:54:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我小时候 天上可没人来干涉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No man in the sky intervened when I was a boy
Dialogue: 0,1:54:36.86,1:54:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸的拳头和憎恶 将我从中解救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to deliver me from daddy's fist and abominations. Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.90,1:54:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我早就明白了 如果神是全能的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured out way back, if god is all-powerful,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.70,1:54:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那他就不可能至善至美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he cannot be all-good.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:46.84,1:54:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他至善至美{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he is all-good,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.41,1:54:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那他就不可能全能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then he cannot be all-powerful.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:50.75,1:54:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,而这两者 你都不可能{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And neither can you be.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:53.03,1:54:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们需要亲眼看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need to see the fraud you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.18,1:54:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你的假象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With their eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.75,1:55:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你手上的鲜血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The blood on your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.62,1:55:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你干了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.04,1:55:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚他们就会看到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And tonight, they will.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.69,1:55:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我的朋友 因为你要去赴约{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Because you, my friend, have a date.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.86,1:55:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,要飞越海湾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Across the bay.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.47,1:55:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他积聚了两年的恨意 是时候爆发了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ripe fruit, his hate. Two years growing.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.97,1:55:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,不过逼他爆发 倒没怎么费力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it did not take much to push him over, actually.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:14.97,1:55:16.43,Default,,0,0,0,,红色小标注 大爆炸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little red notes, big bang.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:16.43,1:55:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你害死了你的家人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let your family die!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:19.27,1:55:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你要飞到他那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you will fly to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.15,1:55:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,和他战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you will battle him.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.27,1:55:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,至死方休{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To the death.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.78,1:55:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,黑与蓝 对决之夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black and blue. Fight night!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:31.36,1:55:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,世界历史上最伟大的角斗士比赛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The greatest gladiator match in the history of the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.78,1:55:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,天神对凡人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God versus man.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.16,1:55:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,白昼对黑夜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Day versus night.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.06,1:55:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,氪星之子对哥谭蝙蝠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of Krypton versus bat of Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:43.13,1:55:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我会为了你 而与他一战?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I'll fight him for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:45.92,1:55:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 我认为你会为了你生命中的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I do. I think you will fight-fight-fight
Dialogue: 0,1:55:48.17,1:55:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那位特别的女士战斗 战斗 战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for that special lady in your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.14,1:55:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,她在地面很安全 而你呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's safe on the ground. How about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:52.72,1:55:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,快说到了 不过我说的不是露易丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close, but I am not talking about Lois.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.08,1:55:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不是她 每个男孩的特别的女士都是母亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Every boy's special lady is his mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.27,1:56:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,(女巫)
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.31,1:56:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,(女巫)
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.15,1:56:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,玛莎 玛莎 玛莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Martha, Martha, Martha.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.63,1:56:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,飞天恶魔的母亲一定是个女巫{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, the mother of a flying demon must be a witch.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.60,1:56:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对女巫的刑罚 是什么来着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The punishment for witches, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.47,1:56:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 被火烧死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right. Death by fire.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:24.38,1:56:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,(女巫)
Dialogue: 0,1:56:29.96,1:56:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,她在哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.21,1:56:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 我不会让他们告诉我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know! I would not let them tell me!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.93,1:56:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你要是杀了我 玛莎就会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you kill me, Martha dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.52,1:56:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你飞走 玛莎也会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you fly away, mmm, Martha also dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.69,1:56:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但你要是杀了那蝙蝠...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you kill the bat...
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.69,1:56:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,玛莎就能活下来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Martha lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:47.03,1:56:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.82,1:56:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这就对了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.87,1:56:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,现在神都屈服于我的意志了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now god bends to my will.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:03.21,1:57:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在摄像机在你的飞船里等待着{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh, now the cameras are waiting at your ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:05.38,1:57:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,等待着让全世界看到神的缺陷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the world to see the holes in the holy.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:07.65,1:57:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 全能的神在需要之时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the almighty comes clean
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.15,1:57:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,便会尽显他的肮脏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about how dirty he is when it counts.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:10.52,1:57:11.63,Default,,0,0,0,,想救玛莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To save Martha,
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.22,1:57:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,就把蝙蝠的头带给我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bring me the head of the bat.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.69,1:57:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,圣母啊 你能看看时间吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother of god, would you look at the time?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:21.56,1:57:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你到这里时 还有一个小时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you came here, you had an hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.17,1:57:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,现在更少了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now it's less.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:27.92,1:58:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,(坠毁点活动异常)
Dialogue: 0,1:58:28.73,1:58:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在现场的是布鲁克·鲍德温{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brooke Baldwin is on the scene.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:30.43,1:58:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁克 直播交给你 你看到什么了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brooke, you're live on the air. What are you seeing?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.67,1:58:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,飞船那边有状况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something happening at the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.64,1:58:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,它在发出大量能量波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sending massive power surges.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:37.88,1:58:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,警方的直升机已包围该区域{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police helicopters surrounding the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:39.76,1:58:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在管制中心的周围设了路障{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've created a barricade around this containment center.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.01,1:58:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正试图靠近一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're trying to get a little bit closer here
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.61,1:58:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,来搞清楚是怎么回事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to find out what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:46.31,1:58:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这里混乱不堪 你们能看到那道闪电{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is absolute chaos. You can see that lightning,
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.32,1:58:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,还有那些电波{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}those surges of electricity.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:50.15,1:58:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,它们似乎每分钟都在变得更为猛烈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They seem to be getting stronger by the minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:53.25,1:58:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,去星球日报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daily planet.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.99,1:58:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,露易丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lois.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.53,1:59:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须去哥谭 说服他帮助我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to go to Gotham to convince him to help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:00.74,1:59:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,谁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:03.80,1:59:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,否则他就得死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or he has to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:05.83,1:59:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:10.44,1:59:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,这世上没人能一直善良下去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one stays good in this world.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.55,1:59:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但截至目前 这座城市的大部分地区仍处于停电状态{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as of right now, much of the city remains in the dark tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:25.55,1:59:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那么多混乱 那么多让人费解的事 都在今晚的大都会发生了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Much chaos. Much confusing happening on the streets of Metropolis tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.89,1:59:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,直升机仍包围着该区域{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those helicopters are still surrounding the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.81,1:59:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你们能否看到那些闪电...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if you can still see those bolts of lightning...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.53,1:59:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,(一则新消息 来自 布鲁斯·韦恩 男孩也会分享)
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.69,1:59:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,(破解了卢瑟的硬盘 发现了你的照片 但它并不属于你)
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.01,2:00:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,(它就是你)
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.81,2:00:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,(你是谁)
Dialogue: 0,2:00:16.94,2:00:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,(你到过哪)
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.32,2:00:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,(莱克斯集团  超人类研究)
Dialogue: 0,2:00:30.04,2:00:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,(警告: 未授权来源文件  更多)
