Dialogue: 0,2:01:04.99,2:01:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,(美军水下无人航行器A1资料 汤加海沟)
Dialogue: 0,2:01:07.99,2:01:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,(美军水下无人航行器A2资料)
Dialogue: 0,2:01:28.26,2:01:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,(美军水下无人航行器A1资料)
Dialogue: 0,2:01:34.85,2:01:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,(星际实验室资料 塞拉斯·斯通记录日志)
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.45,2:01:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,2400小时又2分钟 对象正在迅速衰弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2400 hours and 2 minutes. Subject declining rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:41.49,2:01:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,所有程序上的干预手段都失败了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All procedural interventions have failed.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.42,2:01:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,结果{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Outcome
Dialogue: 0,2:01:48.60,2:01:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,将是死亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will be death.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.54,2:02:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,塞拉斯·斯通医生暂停了所有临床协议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Silas stone suspending all clinical protocol.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:01.55,2:02:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,美国政府 对象6-19-82 已成功激活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Us gov, object 6-19-82 is successfully activated.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:29.70,2:02:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我要一架直升机去哥谭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a chopper to Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:31.20,2:02:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,打电话给直升机场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call the heliport.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:32.03,2:02:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,直升机? 我们连自行车都快承担不起了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chopper? We can barely afford a bicycle.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:34.33,2:02:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你想追新闻?{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna chase a story?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:35.34,2:02:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,去飞船那{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:36.25,2:02:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,超人可能已经在那了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman's probably there already.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:38.01,2:02:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,佩里 这不是为了新闻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perry, it's not for a story.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:45.65,2:02:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,珍妮 给她弄一架直升机去哥谭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jenny, get her a chopper to Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:47.35,2:02:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,别停到停机坪 给我停到楼顶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And forget the heliport. Put it on the goddamn roof.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:49.89,2:02:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,停到楼顶 露易丝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the roof, Lois!
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.06,2:02:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去哪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we headed?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.73,2:02:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:12.91,2:03:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.28,2:03:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,布鲁斯 别这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruce. Please.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:20.42,2:03:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我错了 你得听我说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong. You have to listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:23.71,2:03:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,莱克斯想要我们...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lex wants us to...
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.94,2:03:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.28,2:03:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.28,2:03:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.96,2:05:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,待着别动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:04.53,2:05:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我真想出手 你早就没命了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I wanted it, you'd be dead already.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:45.03,2:05:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,吸进去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe it in.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:49.40,2:05:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是恐惧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's fear.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.87,2:05:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你并不勇敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not brave.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:59.61,2:06:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,人类才勇敢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men are brave.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.91,2:09:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我打赌你父母曾教导你说 你的存在是有意义的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet your parents taught you that you mean something.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:55.58,2:09:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,说你来到这里是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you're here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:58.75,2:10:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,而我父母教了我不同的一课{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My parents taught me a different lesson,
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.86,2:10:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,他们完全毫无缘由地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dying in the gutter
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.93,2:10:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,死在了排水沟边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for no reason at all.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.68,2:10:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们教导我 只有你逼迫这个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They taught me the world only makes sense
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.35,2:10:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,它才会变得合理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you force it to.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:06.22,2:11:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来都不是神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were never a god.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.42,2:11:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你甚至从来都不是人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were never even a man.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:20.53,2:11:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在让他杀掉玛莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're letting him kill Martha.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:29.54,2:11:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:32.55,2:11:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么提那个名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you say that name?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:35.38,2:11:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,找到他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find him.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:39.19,2:11:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,救出{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save
Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.89,2:11:42.59,Default,,0,0,0,,玛莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Martha.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:45.52,2:11:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,玛莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Martha.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:47.83,2:11:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,(玛莎·韦恩 1946年至1981年)
Dialogue: 0,2:12:17.72,2:12:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,玛莎{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Martha.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:23.83,2:12:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么提那个名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you say that name?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:26.93,2:12:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,玛莎 你为什么提那个名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Martha! Why did you say that name?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:28.77,2:12:30.07,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克 住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:30.07,2:12:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 住手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:31.44,2:12:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么提那个名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you say that name?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:33.11,2:12:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他母亲的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's his mother's name!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:35.58,2:12:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那是他母亲的名字{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's his mother's name.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:09.44,2:13:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没得到任何答案{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not getting any answers.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:10.42,2:13:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们仍在管制中心外面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're still right outside the containment center.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:12.63,2:13:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,情况非常危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dangerous situation.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:13.71,2:13:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,军方和警员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Military and police personnel
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.15,2:13:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,正在包围该区域{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}surrounding the area.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:32.23,2:13:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,卢瑟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luthor.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:33.50,2:13:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他想要你的命来换她的命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wanted your life for hers.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:37.17,2:13:38.53,Default,,0,0,0,,她时间不多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's losing time.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:39.01,2:13:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那艘侦查飞船似乎在吸取城市的电力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The scout ship seems to be drawing power from the city.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:41.91,2:13:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是莱克斯干的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got to be Lex.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:43.48,2:13:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,飞船那边需要你 我会找到她的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need you at that ship. I'll find her.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:46.21,2:13:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我母亲需要我 - 等等{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- My mother needs me. - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.42,2:13:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我向你保证{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make you a promise.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:51.85,2:13:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,今晚玛莎不会死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Martha won't die tonight.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:20.85,2:14:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩老爷{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:22.22,2:14:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:23.45,2:14:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我偷听了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I'm sorry for listening in,
Dialogue: 0,2:14:25.22,2:14:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我追踪俄国人的手机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've tracked the Russian's phone
Dialogue: 0,2:14:26.75,2:14:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,追踪到了一间靠近港口的仓库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to a warehouse near the port.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:28.42,2:14:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,已帮你锁定直飞路线{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're locked onto it.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:29.96,2:14:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我不值得你这样 阿尔弗雷德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't deserve you, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:31.75,2:14:33.99,Default,,0,0,0,,没错 先生 你是不值得{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.11,2:14:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕要说再见了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.58,2:15:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们每说一次再见 你就离死亡更近了一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every time we say goodbye, you die a little.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:15.93,2:15:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把它打下来 - 打啊 快打{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Take it down. - Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:41.09,2:15:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德 你来操控{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to take it, Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:43.62,2:15:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rght.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:45.00,2:15:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,开启无人机模式{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commencing drone mode.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:50.04,2:15:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,热成像显示{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thermal imaging is showing me
Dialogue: 0,2:15:51.87,2:15:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,三楼有二十四个敌人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two dozen hostiles on the third floor.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.47,2:15:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,不如我把你放在二楼吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't I drop you off on the second?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:02.73,2:19:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,放下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:05.36,2:19:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了放下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said drop it!
Dialogue: 0,2:19:08.23,2:19:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我会杀了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill her.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:11.40,2:19:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我 我会动手的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:16.51,2:19:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我相信你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:29.84,2:19:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 我是你儿子的一个朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. I'm a friend of your son's.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:33.06,2:19:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我猜到了 你也有披风{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured. The cape.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:04.06,2:20:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,迟到了 迟到了 小白兔说道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Late, late," says the white rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:04.06,2:20:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:20:05.59,2:20:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,离重生还有40秒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}40 seconds to animation.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:07.39,2:20:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗 小白兔{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, wabbit?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:09.43,2:20:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你没招了 也没时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of tricks, out of time.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:13.87,2:20:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,还少了蝙蝠的头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one bat head short.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:16.37,2:20:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,离重生还有30秒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}30 seconds to animation.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:18.98,2:20:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,厨师来电了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} That'll be the cook.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:19.97,2:20:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,失陪下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:21.27,2:20:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哥谭烤肉 全熟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotham roast. Well done.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:24.08,2:20:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你好 爆出坏消息吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello. Break the bad news.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:26.25,2:20:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我更想当面爆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather do the breaking in person.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:29.15,2:20:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,离重生还有20秒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}20 seconds to animation.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.88,2:20:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你输了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've lost.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:32.92,2:20:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么输{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how to lose.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:34.45,2:20:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你会学会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll learn.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:35.32,2:20:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我会学会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll learn.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:36.96,2:20:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不恨罪恶之人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't hate the sinner.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:39.46,2:20:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我恨的是罪恶本身 - 离重生还有10秒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I hate the sin. - 10 seconds to animation.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:41.87,2:20:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,而你的罪恶 我的朋友 就是你的存在{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yours, my friend, is existing.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:45.06,2:20:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能让你赢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot let you win.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.42,2:20:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我给了那蝙蝠一战的机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave the bat a fighting chance to do it,
Dialogue: 0,2:20:47.93,2:20:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但他不够强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he was not strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:49.00,2:20:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,所以 如果凡人杀不了天神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, if man won't kill god...
Dialogue: 0,2:20:51.00,2:20:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,二 一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...two, one.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:54.84,2:20:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那就让魔鬼代劳吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the devil will do it!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.32,2:21:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,佩里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perry!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:14.09,2:21:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 各位保持冷静{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Stay calm, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,2:21:16.76,2:21:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们收到报告称这座城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're getting reports there are total blackouts
Dialogue: 0,2:21:18.20,2:21:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,从北部到西北部都完全停电了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the north and to the northwest of the city.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:20.97,2:21:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,联邦政府正在试图查明{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Federal authorities are trying to determine
Dialogue: 0,2:21:22.21,2:21:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这是否是一次大规模恐怖袭击的一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if this is part of a larger terrorist attack.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:29.04,2:21:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,古老的氪星畸形生物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ancient Kryptonian deformity.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:33.01,2:21:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,吾血之血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Blood of my blood.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:42.39,2:21:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,生来就为了毁灭你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Born to destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:47.29,2:21:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是  你的毁灭日{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your doomsday.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:12.48,2:22:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,现在 神{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now god is good
Dialogue: 0,2:22:15.82,2:22:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,死定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:40.91,2:23:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,总统来电了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Potus joining.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:42.31,2:23:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,总统先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. president.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:43.68,2:23:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那到底是什么东西 卡尔文{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is it, Calvin?
Dialogue: 0,2:23:44.85,2:23:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,这些是来自大都会市中心莱克斯集团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are live images from the top
Dialogue: 0,2:23:47.35,2:23:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,塔楼楼顶的直播画面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the lexcorp tower in downtown Metropolis.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:49.25,2:23:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,军用飞机已抵达现场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Military aircraft are on the scene.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:03.00,2:24:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你受伤了吗 女士 - 我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you hurt, ma'am? - I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:04.96,2:24:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好  你会没事的 好吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. You're gonna be all right, okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:24:16.51,2:24:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这个东西就在几分钟前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing emerged from the Kryptonian
Dialogue: 0,2:24:18.88,2:24:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,从氪星飞船坠毁点出现了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}crash site just moments ago.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:21.18,2:24:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不过幸好市中心核心区的人都下班了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thankfully though, the work day is over in the downtown core.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:24.43,2:24:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那里几乎没人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nearly empty.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:25.72,2:24:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,现在军用飞机 那些是阿帕奇直升机{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now military aircraft. Those are apache helicopters.
Dialogue: 0,2:24:29.46,2:24:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,它们刚刚到达 画面...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have now just arrived. The images that...
Dialogue: 0,2:25:06.39,2:25:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,(军队与怪物发生冲突)
Dialogue: 0,2:25:08.19,2:25:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们...我们刚与大都会新闻8台失去了通讯连接{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've, uh... We just lost connection with Metropolis 8 news.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:11.40,2:25:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,现在不清楚那里发生了什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, it's not clear what just happened.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:17.34,2:25:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那边怎么了 阿尔弗雷德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening there, Alfred?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:20.74,2:25:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么说好呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How best to describe it?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:22.71,2:25:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,大都会空域已被暂时关闭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Metropolis airspace has been closed briefly.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:24.61,2:25:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我能打扰下吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:25.49,2:25:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们恳请您待在座位上{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We kindly ask that you stay in your seats.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:26.58,2:25:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我能打扰下吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:28.25,2:25:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,普林斯小姐{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss prince?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:44.10,2:25:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 看 他们已离开城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir. Look, they've cleared the city.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:46.10,2:25:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,他好像在把它带入太空{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like he's taking it into space.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:47.77,2:25:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以直接按下红色按钮了 总统先生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can go straight to key red, Mr. president.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:49.60,2:25:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,还不行 你疯了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not yet. Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,2:25:51.24,2:25:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他们飞得够高了 我们能用核弹攻击他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're high enough that we can nuke 'em
Dialogue: 0,2:25:52.69,2:25:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不会有一人伤亡 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with no casualties, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:53.91,2:25:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,会有一人 总统先生 超人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One casualty, Mr. president. Superman.
Dialogue: 0,2:25:59.41,2:26:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,愿上帝宽恕我们所有人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God have mercy on us all.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:07.12,2:26:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 已插入钥匙 - 已插入钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Key is hot. - Key is hot.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:08.70,2:26:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,红鸟已就位 等待发射 长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red birds are armed to deploy, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:12.46,2:26:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,发射吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire at will.
Dialogue: 0,2:26:13.76,2:26:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,三 二 一{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, two, one...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:04.81,2:27:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:28.66,2:27:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,一号抛体 撞击了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Projectile 1. Impact.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:30.04,2:27:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大都会东部  斯特瑞克之岛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stryker's island, east of Metropolis.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:31.74,2:27:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,那里无人居住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's uninhabited.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:33.04,2:27:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,二号抛体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Projectile 2...
Dialogue: 0,2:27:40.15,2:27:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,无明显重返大气层迹象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No apparent reentry.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:42.35,2:27:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,二号抛体呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Projectile 2?
Dialogue: 0,2:27:44.32,2:27:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,超人 总统先生 二号抛体是超人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Superman, Mr. president. Projectile 2 was superman.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:50.16,2:27:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,长官{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:27:52.47,2:27:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,它在移动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's moving.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:34.73,2:28:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,冲击波越来越强了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shockwaves are getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:36.44,2:28:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我们每击中它一次 都会让它变得更强{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every time we hit it, we make it more powerful.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:39.61,2:28:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't attack.
Dialogue: 0,2:28:42.27,2:28:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,卡尔文 你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you saying, Calvin?
Dialogue: 0,2:28:44.74,2:28:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我在说它是杀不死的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm saying it's unkillable.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:14.80,2:29:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩老爷 接收得到我的信号吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Wayne, are you receiving me?
Dialogue: 0,2:29:16.81,2:29:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alfred.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:17.98,2:29:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,它是氪星生物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Kryptonian.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:19.81,2:29:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,只有氪石武器才能杀死它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only kryptonite weapons can kill it.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:22.52,2:29:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧 如果你有剩余的话{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They might. If you had any left.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:25.98,2:29:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我还剩一发氪石弹{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got one round left.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:29.16,2:29:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那根矛 阿尔弗雷德 那根矛 是纯氪石做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The spear. Alfred, the spear. It's pure kryptonite.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:33.33,2:29:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,它在哥谭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's back in Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:35.09,2:29:37.96,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我能刺穿它的皮肤 那根矛就能杀死它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can penetrate the skin, the spear will kill it.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:37.96,2:29:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,理论上是这样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would in theory.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:39.33,2:29:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我得引它追着我回到哥谭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've gotta get it to chase me back to the city.
Dialogue: 0,2:29:42.13,2:29:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,回到氪石那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to the kryptonite.
Dialogue: 0,2:30:44.53,2:30:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:35.69,2:31:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么把它带回这座城市{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you bring him back to the city?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:37.62,2:31:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这个港口已被废弃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The port is abandoned.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:39.12,2:31:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有能杀死它的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a weapon here that can kill it.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:53.56,2:31:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到那根矛了吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you find the spear?
Dialogue: 0,2:31:55.80,2:31:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我有点忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been a little busy.
Dialogue: 0,2:31:57.22,2:32:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这个东西 这个生物 似乎是靠吸收能量活着的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing, this creature, seems to feed on energy.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:02.68,2:32:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,这个东西来自另一个世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thing is from another world.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:06.77,2:32:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My world.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:07.85,2:32:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前杀过来自其他世界的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've killed things from other worlds before.
Dialogue: 0,2:32:12.52,2:32:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,她跟你一伙的吗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she with you?
Dialogue: 0,2:32:14.32,2:32:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我还以为她跟你一伙的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought she was with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:35:54.67,2:35:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:05.05,2:36:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:16.60,2:36:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark!
Dialogue: 0,2:36:18.50,2:36:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克 你没事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,2:36:57.94,2:36:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:03.27,2:37:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 不行 克拉克 你不能去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, Clark, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:08.45,2:37:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这里是我的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my world.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:10.38,2:37:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 克拉克 别去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Clark, don't.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:15.45,2:37:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你是我的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are my world.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:17.82,2:37:18.75,Default,,0,0,0,,不行{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:37:22.13,2:37:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,求你了 克拉克{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Clark!
Dialogue: 0,2:42:39.22,2:42:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,(《星球日报》 超人已死 恐惧之夜 失落之晨)
Dialogue: 0,2:42:43.86,2:42:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,(《星球日报》 记者克拉克·肯特在报道哥谭之战中遇害)
Dialogue: 0,2:42:46.20,2:42:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,(莱克斯·卢瑟因涉嫌国会大厦炸弹袭击被捕)
Dialogue: 0,2:43:12.76,2:43:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,(肯尼迪已死)
Dialogue: 0,2:44:29.82,2:44:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,2:44:37.90,2:44:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,克拉克之前把这个寄了过来 想给你个惊喜{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clark had this sent here, so he could surprise you.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:07.71,2:47:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,死者要复活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"The dead shall live.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:07.71,2:47:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:47:10.71,2:47:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,尸首要兴起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"My slain shall rise again.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:16.92,2:47:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,睡在尘埃的啊 要醒起歌唱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Awake and sing, ye that dwell in dust.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:21.23,2:47:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,因你的甘露好像菜蔬上的甘露{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"For thy dew is like the dew of morning.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:26.40,2:47:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,地也要交出死人来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"And the earth shall give birth to her dead."
Dialogue: 0,2:47:39.28,2:47:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要搭车回家一趟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} I need a ride back to the house.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:41.41,2:47:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我忘带支票本了 还要付钱给殡葬承办人呢{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot my checkbook to pay the funeral director.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:44.12,2:47:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说全都付清了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They said it's all taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,2:47:46.25,2:47:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,谁付的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By whom?
Dialogue: 0,2:47:48.25,2:47:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,匿名捐赠者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anonymous donor.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:33.80,2:48:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,东部的那些表演只是为了下葬一副空棺材{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All those circuses back east burying an empty box.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:37.97,2:48:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不知道如何缅怀他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't know how to honor him,
Dialogue: 0,2:48:41.07,2:48:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,只能当做军人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except as a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:44.64,2:48:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他活着时 我辜负了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've failed him in life.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:49.45,2:48:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,他死后 我不会再辜负他了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't fail him in death.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:53.25,2:48:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我找到其他像你这样的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me find the others like you.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:55.92,2:48:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他们不希望被找到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps they don't want to be found.
Dialogue: 0,2:48:58.79,2:49:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会的 他们还要战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They will. And they'll fight.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:02.79,2:49:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须联手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to stand together.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:12.50,2:49:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,一百年前 我离开了人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}100 years ago, I walked away from mankind.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:17.81,2:49:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,远离了一个世纪的恐怖万象{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From a century of horrors.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:23.35,2:49:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,人类创造了一个不可能联手的世界{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man made a world where standing together is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:30.12,2:49:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,人类依然优秀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men are still good.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:34.52,2:49:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们争斗 厮杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We fight. We kill.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:38.63,2:49:40.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我们相互背叛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We betray one another.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:42.90,2:49:44.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们能重新开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we can rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:46.20,2:49:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我们能做得更好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can do better.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:49.34,2:49:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will.
Dialogue: 0,2:49:51.38,2:49:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:09.84,2:50:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,(如果你在寻找他的丰碑 看看你的周围吧)
Dialogue: 0,2:50:15.67,2:50:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,其他像我一样的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The others like me.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:17.24,2:50:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你说他们必须战斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you say they'll have to fight?
Dialogue: 0,2:50:24.91,2:50:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一种感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a feeling.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:38.36,2:50:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,囚犯 A-C-23-19-40{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prisoner A-C-23-19-40.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:40.96,2:50:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,监狱长想跟你谈话 站起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The warden wants to speak to you, so stand to your feet.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:45.30,2:50:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我再说一遍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna say this one more time.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:47.20,2:50:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,监狱长想跟你谈话 站起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The warden wants to speak to you, so stand to your feet.
Dialogue: 0,2:50:57.87,2:50:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,转过身 面朝墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn around and face the wall.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:01.81,2:51:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,前额靠住墙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Place your forehead against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:04.22,2:51:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,双手放背后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your hands behind your back,
Dialogue: 0,2:51:06.12,2:51:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我进来好控制你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that I can come in and restrain you.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:36.48,2:51:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,无论你做什么 无论你去哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you do, wherever you go,
Dialogue: 0,2:51:39.42,2:51:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我都会盯着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be watching you.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:44.99,2:51:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,看看我们啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at us.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:47.66,2:51:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一切就是这样分崩离析的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is how it all caves in.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:49.96,2:51:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,韦恩庄园的文明被丢弃了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Civilization on the Wayne manor's out the window.
Dialogue: 0,2:51:59.44,2:52:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,但是谁会相信我呢 我...{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But who would believe me? I...
Dialogue: 0,2:52:02.34,2:52:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我疯了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm insane.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:06.04,2:52:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我都没法受审{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not even fit to stand trial.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:08.21,2:52:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:10.15,2:52:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,以同情心对待精神病患者的医院有不少{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have hospitals that treat the mentally ill with compassion.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:15.29,2:52:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但那里不是你要去的地方{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:17.29,2:52:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我已给你安排好转去哥谭的阿卡姆疯人院{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I arranged for you to get transferred to arkham asylum in Gotham.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:22.19,2:52:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我在那里还有些朋友{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still have some friends there.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:24.73,2:52:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在等着你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:30.87,2:52:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但钟声已被敲响{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the bell's already been rung.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:37.57,2:52:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,他们已经听到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they've heard it.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:40.88,2:52:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,在黑暗之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:42.65,2:52:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在群星之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Among the stars.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:48.39,2:52:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,叮咚 神已经死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ding dong, the god is dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:52:48.39,2:52:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:53:01.33,2:53:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但钟声是收不回的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But a bell cannot be unrung!
Dialogue: 0,2:53:05.44,2:53:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他饿了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:07.57,2:53:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他找到我们了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} He's found us.
Dialogue: 0,2:53:10.17,2:53:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他要来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's coming!
